<https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description> <http://ontologydesignpatterns.org/opla/reusesPatternAsTemplate> <http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/cp/owl/collectionentity.owl>;
                                                        <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/creator> "Valentina Presutti (ISTC-CNR, STLab)",
                                                                                                  "Chiara Veninata (MiBAC, ICCD)",
                                                                                                  "Aldo Gangemi (ISTC-CNR, STLab)",
                                                                                                  "Valentina Carriero (ISTC-CNR, STLab)",
                                                                                                  "Andrea Nuzzolese (ISTC-CNR, STLab)",
                                                                                                  "Marialetizia Mancinelli (MiBAC, ICCD)",
                                                                                                  "Ludovica Marinucci (ISTC-CNR, STLab)";
                                                        <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/description> "The Denotative Description module encodes the characteristics of a cultural property, as detectable and/or detected during the cataloguing process and measurable according to a reference system. Examples include measurements e.g. length, constituting materials e.g. clay, employed techniques e.g. melting, conservation status e.g. good, decent, bad."@en,
                                                                                                      "Questo modulo, detto della descrizione denotativa (denotazione è inteso come l'atto di indicare una cosa attraverso segni esteriori), modella le caratteristiche di un bene culturale, individuabili e/o individuate durante il processo di catalogazione e misurabili in accordo con un sistema di riferimento. Esempi includono misure es. lunghezza, materia es. argilla, tecniche es. fusione, stato di conservazione es. buono, discreto, cattivo."@it;
                                                        <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/language> <http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/ITA>,
                                                                                                   <http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/ENG>;
                                                        <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/title> "Ontologia della Descrizione Denotativa (ArCo network)"@it,
                                                                                                "Denotative Description Ontology (ArCo network)"@en;
                                                        <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2018-03-07";
                                                        <http://purl.org/dc/terms/license> <https://w3id.org/italia/controlled-vocabulary/licences/A31_CCBYSA40>,
                                                                                           <https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/>;
                                                        <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2019-06-01";
                                                        <http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/opla/reusesPatternAsTemplate> <http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/cp/owl/situation.owl>,
                                                                                                                             <http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/cp/owl/classification.owl>,
                                                                                                                             <http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/cp/owl/descriptionandsituation.owl>;
                                                        a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology>;
                                                        rdfs:comment """Questo modulo, detto della descrizione denotativa (denotazione è inteso come l'atto di indicare una cosa attraverso segni esteriori), modella le caratteristiche di un bene culturale, individuabili e/o individuate durante il processo di catalogazione e misurabili in accordo con un sistema di riferimento. Esempi includono misure es. lunghezza, materia es. argilla, tecniche es. fusione, stato di conservazione es. buono, discreto, cattivo.
In questo modulo si riusano come template i seguenti Ontology Design Patterns:
- http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/cp/owl/collectionentity.owl
- http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/cp/owl/classification.owl
- http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/cp/owl/descriptionandsituation.owl
- http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/cp/owl/situation.owl"""@it,
                                                                     """The Denotative Description module encodes the characteristics of a cultural property, as detectable and/or detected during the cataloguing process and measurable according to a reference system. Examples include measurements e.g. length, constituting materials e.g. clay, employed techniques e.g. melting, conservation status e.g. good, decent, bad.
In this module are used as template the following Ontology Design Patterns:
- http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/cp/owl/collectionentity.owl
- http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/cp/owl/classification.owl
- http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/cp/owl/descriptionandsituation.owl
- http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/cp/owl/situation.owl"""@en;
                                                        rdfs:label "Denotative Description Ontology (ArCo network)"@en,
                                                                   "Ontologia della Descrizione Denotativa (ArCo network)"@it;
                                                        <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#imports> <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/location>,
                                                                                                <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/context-description>,
                                                                                                <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/core>;
                                                        <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "Versione 1.0"@it,
                                                                                                    "Version 1.0"@en.
ddesc:Accessible a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
                   ddesc:CulturalPropertyAccessibility;
                 rdfs:label "Accessibile"@it,
                            "Accessible"@en.
ddesc:Accessory a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
                rdfs:comment "This class represents an accessory of a musical property, both if it is functional to the sound production, or if it is the sound's production or conservation medium."@en,
                             "Questa classe rappresenta un accessorio di un bene musicale, ovvero un oggetto collegabile al bene musicale, sia nel caso in cui sia funzionale alla produzione del suono, sia nel caso in cui sia di supporto alla produzione del suono o alla conservazione o alla prassi musicale del bene."@it;
                rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                rdfs:label "Accessory"@en,
                           "Accessorio"@it;
                rdfs:subClassOf [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> ddesc:creationDate ; 
                                 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#allValuesFrom> rdfs:Literal ; 
                                 a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>],
                                <https://w3id.org/italia/onto/l0/Object>,
                                [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#someValuesFrom> <http://dati.beniculturali.it/cis/CulturalEntity> ; 
                                 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> ddesc:isAccessoryOf ; 
                                 a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>];
                <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stable"@en,
                                                            "stabile"@it;
                <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "ICCD Normativa SM 4.00: AS/ASS/ASST".
ddesc:AffixedElement <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/description> """Un esempio d'uso di una delle sottoclassi della classe \"Elemento apposto su bene culturale\" è il seguente:
resource:Inscription/1200865151-inscription-1
        a   dd:Inscription ;
        rdfs:label \"Iscrizione 1 del bene culturale 1200865151\"@en ;
        dd:hasFontStyle resource:FontStyle/lettere-capitali ;
        dd:hasTechnicalDetailOccurrence resource:TechnicalDetailOccurrence/1200865151-inscription-1-material-technique-1 ;
        dd:positionOnCulturalProperty \"al centro\" ;
        dd:transcript \"PAVLVS VENETVS PAPA SECVNDVS SVIS IMPENSIS FIERI FECIT ANNO CRISTI MCCCLXVII\" ;
        language:hasLanguage resource:Language/latino ."""@it,
                                                                   """An example of usage of one of the subclasses of the class 'Affixed element' is the following:
resource:Inscription/1200865151-inscription-1
        a   dd:Inscription ;
        rdfs:label \"Inscription 1 of cultural property 1200865151\"@en ;
        dd:hasFontStyle resource:FontStyle/lettere-capitali ;
        dd:hasTechnicalDetailOccurrence resource:TechnicalDetailOccurrence/1200865151-inscription-1-material-technique-1 ;
        dd:positionOnCulturalProperty \"in the middle\" ;
        dd:transcript \"PAVLVS VENETVS PAPA SECVNDVS SVIS IMPENSIS FIERI FECIT ANNO CRISTI MCCCLXVII\" ;
        language:hasLanguage resource:Language/latino ."""@en;
                     a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
                     rdfs:comment "This class represents an element (i.e. crest, trademark, postmark, inscription) which is affixed on a cultural property."@en,
                                  "Questa classe rappresenta un elemento (stemma, marchio, timbro, emblema, logo, iscrizione, etc.) apposto su un bene culturale."@it;
                     rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                     rdfs:label "Element affixed on cultural property"@en,
                                "Elemento apposto su bene culturale"@it;
                     rdfs:subClassOf [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> ddesc:transcript ; 
                                      <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#allValuesFrom> rdfs:Literal ; 
                                      a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>],
                                     <https://w3id.org/italia/onto/l0/Object>,
                                     [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> ddesc:italianTranslation ; 
                                      <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#allValuesFrom> rdfs:Literal ; 
                                      a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>],
                                     [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> ddesc:hasSupport ; 
                                      <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#allValuesFrom> ddesc:Support ; 
                                      a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>],
                                     [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> ddesc:hasFunctionalPurpose ; 
                                      <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#allValuesFrom> ddesc:FunctionalPurpose ; 
                                      a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>],
                                     [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/core/description> ; 
                                      <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#allValuesFrom> rdfs:Literal ; 
                                      a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>],
                                     [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> ddesc:hasWritingSystem ; 
                                      <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#allValuesFrom> ddesc:WritingSystem ; 
                                      a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>],
                                     [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/context-description/hasAuthor> ; 
                                      <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#allValuesFrom> <https://w3id.org/italia/onto/l0/Agent> ; 
                                      a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>],
                                     [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> ddesc:hasFontStyle ; 
                                      <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#allValuesFrom> ddesc:FontStyle ; 
                                      a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>],
                                     [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#someValuesFrom> <http://dati.beniculturali.it/cis/CulturalEntity> ; 
                                      <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> ddesc:isElementAffixedOn ; 
                                      a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>],
                                     [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> ddesc:hasTechnicalStatus ; 
                                      <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#allValuesFrom> ddesc:CulturalEntityTechnicalStatus ; 
                                      a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>];
                     <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stable"@en,
                                                                 "stabile"@it;
                     <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "ICCD Normativa Trasversale 4.00: DA/ISE - ICCD versioni precedenti alla 4.00: DA/ISR; DA/STM - ICCD Normativa A: LI/LSI"@it.
ddesc:AffixedElementType a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
                         rdfs:comment "Questa classe rappresenta il tipo (es.: gentilizio, civile, religioso, etc.) di un'iscrizione, un emblema, un timbro, uno stemma, etc."@it,
                                      "This class represents the type (i.e. civil, religious) of an inscription, emblem, postmark, crest, etc."@en;
                         rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                         rdfs:label "Affixed element type"@en,
                                    "Tipo di elemento apposto"@it;
                         rdfs:subClassOf <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/core/Type>,
                                         [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#someValuesFrom> ddesc:AffixedElement ; 
                                          <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> ddesc:isAffixedElementTypeOf ; 
                                          a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>];
                         <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                                     "stable"@en;
                         <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "ICCD Normativa Trasversale 4.00: DA/ISE/ISEE - Normative di versioni precedenti: DA/STM/STMQ"@it.
ddesc:AgeRange a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
               rdfs:comment "Questa classe rappresenta la fascia d'età (bambino, ragazzo, adulto  anziano) di una persona."@it,
                            "This class represents the age range (child, teenager, adult, old person) of a person."@en;
               rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
               rdfs:label "Age range"@en,
                          "Fascia d'età"@it;
               rdfs:subClassOf [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#someValuesFrom> ddesc:CommunicationMedium ; 
                                <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> ddesc:isAgeRangeInvolvedIn ; 
                                a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>],
                               <https://w3id.org/italia/onto/l0/Characteristic>;
               <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                           "stable"@en;
               <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "ICCD Normativa BDI: CU/CUC/CUCE; CU/CUP/CUPE".
ddesc:Area a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
             ddesc:MeasurementType;
           rdfs:label "Area"@en,
                      "Area"@it;
           <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                       "stable"@en.
ddesc:AssignedDesignation a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
                            ddesc:DesignationType;
                          rdfs:comment "Questo individuo rappresenta una denominazione attribuita."@it,
                                       "This individual represents an attributed denomination."@en;
                          rdfs:label "Assigned designation"@en,
                                     "Denominazione attribuita"@it;
                          <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                                      "stable"@en;
                          <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "ICCD Normativa Trasversale: OGD/OGDT - Normative A, BDM, PG 3: OGA/OGAG."@it.
ddesc:Available a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
                  ddesc:CulturalPropertyAvailability;
                rdfs:label "Available"@en,
                           "Disponibile"@it.
ddesc:AvailableNotes a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
                       ddesc:TechnicalConcept;
                     rdfs:comment "Questo individuo rappresenta le note producibili da uno strumento musicale, dal grave all'acuto."@it,
                                  "This individual represents playable notes by a musical instrument, from low to high."@en;
                     rdfs:label "Available notes"@en,
                                "Note produbicili"@it;
                     <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                                 "stable"@en;
                     <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "ICCD Normativa SM 4.00: AA/AAN".
ddesc:BackTotalLength a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
                        ddesc:MeasurementType;
                      rdfs:label "Back total length"@en,
                                 "Lunghezza totale parte posteriore"@it;
                      <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                                  "stable"@en.
ddesc:BackWidth a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
                  ddesc:MeasurementType;
                rdfs:label "Back Width"@en,
                           "Larghezza dorso"@it;
                <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                            "stable"@en.
ddesc:BadConservationStatus a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
                              ddesc:ConservationStatusType;
                            rdfs:label "Bad conservation status"@en,
                                       "Stato di conservazione cattivo"@it;
                            <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                                        "stable"@en.
ddesc:Brand a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
            rdfs:comment "Questa classe rappresenta un marchio, ovvero un segno, figura, simbolo impresso o applicato su qualcosa a scopo di distinzione e riconoscimento."@it,
                         "This class represents a brand, that is a sign, an image, a symbol affixed on an object for identification."@en;
            rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
            rdfs:label "Marchio"@it,
                       "Brand"@en;
            rdfs:subClassOf ddesc:AffixedElement;
            <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                        "stable"@en;
            <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "ICCD Normativa Trasversale 4.00: se DA/ISE/ISED = 'marchio' - ICCD versioni precedenti: DA/STM/STMC = 'marchio' - ICCD Normativa A: LI/LSI/LSIG = 'marchio'"@it.
ddesc:Capacity a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
                 ddesc:MeasurementType;
               rdfs:label "Capacity"@en,
                          "Capacità"@it;
               <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                           "stable"@en.
ddesc:ChestCircumference a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
                           ddesc:MeasurementType;
                         rdfs:label "Chest Circumference"@en,
                                    "Circonferenza petto"@it;
                         <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                                     "stable"@en.
ddesc:Circumference a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
                      ddesc:MeasurementType;
                    rdfs:label "Circonferenza"@it,
                               "Circumference"@en;
                    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                                "stable"@en.
ddesc:CoatOfArms a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
                 rdfs:comment "Questa classe rappresenta uno stemma, ovvero un insieme di figure e simboli che, in araldica, vengono rappresentati secondo determinate regole per contrassegnare persone o enti."@it;
                 rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                 rdfs:label "Coat of arms"@en,
                            "Stemma"@it;
                 rdfs:subClassOf ddesc:AffixedElement;
                 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                             "stable"@en;
                 <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "ICCD Normativa Trasversale 4.00: se DA/ISE/ISED = 'stemma' - ICCD versioni precedenti: DA/STM/STMC = 'stemma' - ICCD Normativa A: LI/LSI/LSIG = 'stemma'"@it.
ddesc:CoinDesign a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
                 rdfs:comment "This class represents the design on the reverse or the obverse of a numismatic property, as the graphical part of what is represented on a side of a coin, together with the legend (lettering and wording)."@en,
                              "Questa classe rappresenta la raffigurazione presente sul dritto o sul rovescio di un bene numismatico, intesa come l'insieme degli elementi grafici, che, uniti a una legenda (lettere e parole), fa parte dell'impronta della moneta."@it;
                 rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                 rdfs:label "Coin design"@en,
                            "Raffigurazione su moneta"@it;
                 rdfs:subClassOf ddesc:AffixedElement;
                 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#disjointWith> ddesc:CoinLegend;
                 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                             "stable"@en;
                 <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "ICCD Normativa NU 4.00: DA/DES/DESA; DA/DES/DESM".
ddesc:CoinLegend a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
                 rdfs:comment "Questa classe rappresenta l'insieme di lettere e parole presenti sul dritto o sul rovescio di un bene numismatico, che, unito alla raffigurazione, fa parte dell'impronta della moneta."@it,
                              "This class represents the lettering and wording on the reverse or the obverse of a numismatic property."@en;
                 rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                 rdfs:label "Legenda della moneta"@it,
                            "Coin legend"@en;
                 rdfs:subClassOf ddesc:Inscription;
                 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                             "stable"@en;
                 <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "ICCD Normativa NU 4.00: DA/DES/DELS; DA/DES/DESN; DA/DES/DESF; DA/DES/DESG; DA/DES/DESR; DA/DES/DEST.".
ddesc:CommunicationMedium a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
                          rdfs:comment "Questa classe rappresenta la modalità comunicativa di un oggetto, definita dal tipo di modalità (es.: verbale, scritta, strumentale), la modalità esecutiva, il numero di voci e strumenti coinvolti, etc."@it,
                                       "This class represents the communication medium of an object, defined by the communication medium type (e.g.: verbal, written, instrumental), the implementation method, the number of voices or instruments involved, etc."@en;
                          rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                          rdfs:label "Modalità comunicativa"@it,
                                     "Communication medium"@en;
                          rdfs:subClassOf [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#someValuesFrom> <http://dati.beniculturali.it/cis/CulturalEntity> ; 
                                           <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> ddesc:isCommunicationMediumOf ; 
                                           a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>],
                                          [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> ddesc:involvesAgeRange ; 
                                           <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#allValuesFrom> ddesc:AgeRange ; 
                                           a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>],
                                          [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> ddesc:numberOfChildParticipants ; 
                                           <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#allValuesFrom> xsd:integer ; 
                                           a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>],
                                          [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> ddesc:hasImplementationMethod ; 
                                           <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#allValuesFrom> ddesc:ImplementationMethod ; 
                                           a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>],
                                          [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> ddesc:numberOfMaleParticipants ; 
                                           <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#allValuesFrom> xsd:integer ; 
                                           a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>],
                                          [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> ddesc:numberOfFemaleParticipants ; 
                                           <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#allValuesFrom> xsd:integer ; 
                                           a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>],
                                          <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/core/CulturalEntityCharacteristic>,
                                          [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#someValuesFrom> ddesc:CommunicationMediumType ; 
                                           <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> ddesc:hasCommunicationMediumType ; 
                                           a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>];
                          <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stable"@en,
                                                                      "stabile"@it;
                          <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "ICCD Normativa BDI: CU".
ddesc:CommunicationMediumType a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
                              rdfs:comment "Questa classe rappresenta il tipo di modalità comunicativa."@it,
                                           "This class represents the type of communication medium."@en;
                              rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                              rdfs:label "Tipo di modalità comunicativa"@it,
                                         "Communication medium type"@en;
                              rdfs:subClassOf [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#someValuesFrom> ddesc:CommunicationMedium ; 
                                               <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> ddesc:isCommunicationMediumTypeOf ; 
                                               a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>],
                                              <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/core/Type>;
                              <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                                          "stable"@en;
                              <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "ICCD Normativa BDI: CU".
ddesc:CompleteLegibility a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
                           ddesc:Legibility;
                         rdfs:label "Complete legibility"@en,
                                    "Leggibilità totale"@it.
ddesc:ConservationStatus <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/description> """Un esempio d'uso della classe \"Stato di conservazione\" è il seguente:
resource:ConservationStatus/0900750201-conservation-status-1
        a  a-dd:ConservationStatus ;
        rdfs:label  \"Stato di conservazione 1 del bene: 0900750201\"@it ;
        core:specifications  \"Macchie in corrispondenza della fodera, lungo lo scollo.\" ;
       a-dd:hasConservationStatusType a-dd:GoodConservationStatus ;
        tiapit:time   \"2014\" ."""@it,
                                                                       """An example of usage of the class 'Conservation status' is the following:
resource:ConservationStatus/0900750201-conservation-status-1
        a   dd:ConservationStatus ;
        rdfs:label  \"Conservation status 1 of cultural property: 0900750201\"@en ;
        core:specifications  \"Stains at the lining, along the neckline.\" ;
       dd:hasConservationStatusType dd:GoodConservationStatus ;
        tiapit:time   \"2014\" ."""@en;
                         a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
                         rdfs:comment "Questa classe rappresenta lo stato di conservazione di un bene culturale."@it,
                                      "This class represents the conservation status of the cultural property."@en;
                         rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                         rdfs:label "Conservation Status"@en,
                                    "Stato di Conservazione"@it;
                         rdfs:subClassOf [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> ddesc:hasConservationStatusType ; 
                                          <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#allValuesFrom> ddesc:ConservationStatusType ; 
                                          a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>],
                                         <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/core/Situation>,
                                         [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#someValuesFrom> <http://dati.beniculturali.it/cis/CulturalEntity> ; 
                                          <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> ddesc:isConservationStatusOf ; 
                                          a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>],
                                         [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> ddesc:hasLegibility ; 
                                          <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#allValuesFrom> ddesc:Legibility ; 
                                          a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>];
                         <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stable"@en,
                                                                     "stabile"@it;
                         <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "CO/STC".
ddesc:ConservationStatusType a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
                             rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                             rdfs:label "Conservation Status Type"@en,
                                        "Tipo di stato di conservazione"@it;
                             rdfs:subClassOf [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#someValuesFrom> ddesc:ConservationStatus ; 
                                              <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> ddesc:isConservationStatusTypeOf ; 
                                              a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>],
                                             <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/core/Type>;
                             <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                                         "stable"@en;
                             <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "CO/STC/STCC".
ddesc:Counterstamp a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
                   rdfs:comment "Questa classe rappresenta una contromarca, ovvero una lettera o un altro segno punzonato su una moneta. Una contromarca viene apposta tramite un apposito punzone. La maggior parte delle monete vengono contromarcate per cambiarne il valore in seguito a una riforma monetaria. La contromarca è quindi un segno apposto dall'autorità emittente nel dritto o nel rovescio della moneta in epoca posteriore alla sua emissione, per aumentarne o diminuirne il valore e, in caso di necessità, per rimettere in circolazione monete già ritirate."@it,
                                "This class represent a counterstamp (or countermark), that is a partial or complete over-stamping of a coin, generally affixed in order to change its value or issuing authority."@en;
                   rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                   rdfs:label "Contromarca"@it,
                              "Counterstamp"@en;
                   rdfs:subClassOf ddesc:AffixedElement,
                                   [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/context-description/hasCoinIssuance> ; 
                                    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#allValuesFrom> <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/context-description/CoinIssuance> ; 
                                    a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>];
                   <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                               "stable"@en;
                   <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "ICCD Normativa NU 4.00: DA/CON".
ddesc:CoveredArea a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
                    ddesc:MeasurementType;
                  rdfs:label "Area coperta"@it,
                             "Covered area"@en;
                  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                              "stable"@en.
ddesc:CulturalEntityTechnicalDescription a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
                                         rdfs:comment "This class represents the technical description of a cultural entity, which uses all the technical concepts classifying the technical characteristics that a cultural entity can have. This class is a particular type of the class Description, which is the class for socially constructed objects (i.e. texts, values, categories, relations, contexts) used to describe other objects in a structured manner."@en,
                                                      "Questa classe rappresenta la descrizione tecnica di un'entità culturale, la quale utilizza tutti i concetti tecnici che possono classificare caratteristiche tecniche possedute da un'entità culturale. Questa classe è un tipo particolare di Description, la classe degli oggetti costruiti socialmente (testi, valori, categorie, relazioni, contesti), usati per descrivere qualcos'altro in modo strutturato."@it;
                                         rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3di.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description/>;
                                         rdfs:label "Descrizione tecnica di entità culturale"@it,
                                                    "Cultural entity technical description"@en;
                                         rdfs:subClassOf [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> ddesc:usesTechnicalConcept ; 
                                                          <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#allValuesFrom> ddesc:TechnicalConcept ; 
                                                          a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>],
                                                         <https://w3id.org/italia/onto/l0/Description>,
                                                         [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> ddesc:isTechnicalDescriptionSatisfiedBy ; 
                                                          <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#allValuesFrom> ddesc:CulturalEntityTechnicalStatus ; 
                                                          a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>];
                                         <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                                                     "stable"@en.
ddesc:CulturalEntityTechnicalStatus <http://ontologydesignpatterns.org/opla/isNativeTo> <https://w3id.org/arco/pattern/technical-characteristic/>;
                                    <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/description> """An example of usage of the class 'Cultural entity technical status' is the following:
resource:CulturalEntityTechnicalStatus/0900281817-4
        a           a-dd:CulturalEntityTechnicalStatus ;
        rdfs:label  \"Technical status of cultural property 0900281817-4\"@en ;
        a-dd:includesTechnicalCharacteristic
                resource:TechnicalCharacteristic/centinato, resource:TechnicalCharacteristic/stone-sculpture .

resource:TechnicalCharacteristic/stone-sculpture
        a                    a-dd:TechnicalCharacteristic ;
        rdfs:label           \"stone/ sculpture\" ;
        a-dd:isClassifiedBy  a-dd:MaterialOrTechnique ."""@en,
                                                                                  """Un esempio d'uso della classe \"Stato tecnico di entità culturale\" è il seguente:
resource:CulturalEntityTechnicalStatus/0900281817-4
        a           a-dd:CulturalEntityTechnicalStatus ;
        rdfs:label  \"Stato tecnico del bene culturale 0900281817-4\"@it ;
        a-dd:includesTechnicalCharacteristic
                resource:TechnicalCharacteristic/centinato, resource:TechnicalCharacteristic/pietra-scultura .

resource:TechnicalCharacteristic/pietra-scultura
        a                    a-dd:TechnicalCharacteristic ;
        rdfs:label           \"pietra/ scultura\" ;
        a-dd:isClassifiedBy  a-dd:MaterialOrTechnique ."""@it;
                                    a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
                                    rdfs:comment """Questa classe rappresenta lo stato tecnico di un'entità culturale, cioè una situazione in cui un'entità culturale ha associate una serie di caratteristiche tecniche. Lo stato di un'entità ha associata una validità temporale, relativa al momento in cui quelle caratteristiche sono state rilevate. Per esempio, una occorrenza di un dettaglio tecnico è: \"bene culturale X realizzato con la materia terracotta e di forma cilindrica\"."""@it,
                                                 """This class represents the technical status of a cultural entity, that is a situation in which the cultural entity is associated to technical characteristics. The technical status has a temporal validity, related to the moment when the characteristics were observed. For instance, a cultural property techncal status is: \"the cultural property X realized with pottery material and cylindrical in shape\"."""@en;
                                    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                                    rdfs:label "Stato tecnico di entità culturale"@it,
                                               "Technical status of cultural entity"@en;
                                    rdfs:subClassOf [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#someValuesFrom> ddesc:TechnicalCharacteristic ; 
                                                     <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> ddesc:includesTechnicalCharacteristic ; 
                                                     a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>],
                                                    [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#someValuesFrom> <http://dati.beniculturali.it/cis/CulturalEntity> ; 
                                                     <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> ddesc:isTechnicalStatusOf ; 
                                                     a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>],
                                                    <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/core/Situation>;
                                    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stable"@en,
                                                                                "stabile"@it;
                                    <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "ICCD Normativa Trasversale 4.00: MT/MTC/MTCM; MT/MTC/MTCT - Normativa OA, D, F, S, MI: MT/FRM - Normativa OA, D, F, S: MT/FIL - Normativa VeAC: MT/MTC/MTCC; MT/MTC/MTCF - Normativa F: MT/FVC/FVCC; MT/FVC/FVCF; MT/FVC/FVCP; MT/FVC/FVCU; MT/FVC/FVCM; MT/FVM;".
ddesc:CulturalPropertyAccessibility a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
                                    rdfs:comment "Questa classe rappresenta l'accessibilità di un bene culturale, ovvero la possibilità di accedere al bene, in tutto o in parte, per esempio per effettuare un esame diretto finalizzato alla catalogazione (es.: un bene immobile posto in un luogo recintato non accessibile, un bene mobile che non si può osservare da vicino perché posto troppo in alto su una parete; un bene totalmente accessibile, etc.)."@it,
                                                 "This class represents the cultural property accessibility, that is the possibility to reach or enter that cultural property, for example for cataloguing activities (e.g.: an immovable cultural property located in a walled area, a movable cultural property located on the top shelf, a totally accessible cultural property, etc.)"@en;
                                    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                                    rdfs:label "Accessibilità del bene culturale"@it,
                                               "Cultural property accessibility"@en;
                                    rdfs:subClassOf <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/core/CulturalEntityCharacteristic>,
                                                    [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#someValuesFrom> <http://dati.beniculturali.it/cis/CulturalEntity> ; 
                                                     <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> ddesc:isCulturalPropertyAccessibilityOf ; 
                                                     a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>];
                                    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stable"@en,
                                                                                "stabile"@it;
                                    <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "ICCD Normativa Trasversale 4.00: LC/ACB".
ddesc:CulturalPropertyAvailability a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
                                   rdfs:comment "Questa classe rappresenta la disponibilità materiale di un bene culturale, ovvero se il bene è materialmente disponibile, per esempio per attività di catalogazione, o se non è disponibile (es.: furto, distruzione)"@it,
                                                "This class represents the availability of a cultural property, wheter the cultural property is available or not (e.g.: theft, destruction) for example for cataloguing activities."@en;
                                   rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                                   rdfs:label "Disponibilità materiale del bene culturale"@it,
                                              "Cultural Property Availability"@en;
                                   rdfs:subClassOf [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#someValuesFrom> <http://dati.beniculturali.it/cis/CulturalEntity> ; 
                                                    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> ddesc:isCulturalPropertyAvailabilityOf ; 
                                                    a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>],
                                                   <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/core/CulturalEntityCharacteristic>;
                                   <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                                               "stable"@en;
                                   <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "ICCD Normativa Trasversale 4.00: OG/OGR".
ddesc:CulturalPropertyDefinition a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
                                 rdfs:comment "This class represents the definition of a cultural property. It is the term or expression which identifies the property that is being catalogued."@en,
                                              "Questa classe rappresenta la definizione di un bene culturale, cioè il termine o la locuzione che individua il bene che si sta catalogando."@it;
                                 rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                                 rdfs:label "Cultural Property Definition"@en,
                                            "Definizione del bene culturale"@it;
                                 rdfs:subClassOf [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#someValuesFrom> ddesc:CulturalPropertyType ; 
                                                  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> ddesc:isCulturalPropertyDefinitionOf ; 
                                                  a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>],
                                                 <https://w3id.org/italia/onto/l0/Description>;
                                 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                                             "stable"@en;
                                 <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "OG/OGT/OGTD".
ddesc:CulturalPropertySpecification a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
                                    rdfs:comment "Questa classe rappresenta specifiche morfologiche o funzionali, utili a completare la definizione del bene per una sua più puntuale individuazione."@it,
                                                 "This class represents the morphological or functional specification, which are useful to define a cultural property for a more precise individuation."@en;
                                    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                                    rdfs:label "Specifiche del bene culturale"@it,
                                               "Cultural Property Specification"@en;
                                    rdfs:subClassOf [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#someValuesFrom> ddesc:CulturalPropertyType ; 
                                                     <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> ddesc:isCulturalPropertySpecificationOf ; 
                                                     a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>],
                                                    <https://w3id.org/italia/onto/l0/Description>;
                                    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stable"@en,
                                                                                "stabile"@it;
                                    <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "OG/OGT/OGTT".
ddesc:CulturalPropertyType a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
                           rdfs:comment "Questa classe rappresenta il tipo di bene culturale, cioè il termine o la locuzione che individua il bene che si sta catalogando ed eventuali ulteriori specifiche sulla definizione del bene."@it,
                                        "This class represents a cultural property's type, that is the term or expression which specifies the cultural propery that is being catalogued and additional information on the cultural property's definition."@en;
                           rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                           rdfs:label "Cultural property Type"@en,
                                      "Tipo di bene culturale"@it;
                           rdfs:subClassOf <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/core/Type>,
                                           [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#someValuesFrom> <http://dati.beniculturali.it/cis/CulturalEntity> ; 
                                            <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> ddesc:isCulturalPropertyTypeOf ; 
                                            a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>],
                                           [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#someValuesFrom> ddesc:CulturalPropertyDefinition ; 
                                            <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> ddesc:hasCulturalPropertyDefinition ; 
                                            a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>],
                                           [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> ddesc:hasCulturalPropertySpecification ; 
                                            <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#allValuesFrom> ddesc:CulturalPropertySpecification ; 
                                            a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>];
                           <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stable"@en,
                                                                       "stabile"@it;
                           <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "OG/OGT".
ddesc:CurrentDesignation a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
                           ddesc:DesignationType;
                         rdfs:comment "Questo individuo rappresenta la denominazione attuale."@it,
                                      "This individual represents the current designation."@en;
                         rdfs:label "Current designation"@en,
                                    "Denominazione attuale"@it;
                         <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                                     "stable"@en;
                         <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "ICCD Normativa Trasversale: OGD/OGDT - Normativa A 3: OGA/OGAG."@it.
ddesc:CustomaryDesignation a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
                             ddesc:DesignationType;
                           rdfs:comment "Questo individuo rappresenta una denominazione consuetudinaria."@it,
                                        "This individual represents the usual designation."@en;
                           rdfs:label "Customary designation"@en,
                                      "Denominazione consuetudinaria"@it;
                           <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                                       "stable"@en;
                           <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "ICCD Normativa Trasversale: OGD/OGDT - Normative A e PG 3: OGA/OGAG."@it.
ddesc:DecentConservationStatus a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
                                 ddesc:ConservationStatusType;
                               rdfs:label "Decent conservation status"@en,
                                          "Stato di conservazione discreto"@it;
                               <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                                           "stable"@en.
ddesc:DecentLegibility a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
                         ddesc:Legibility;
                       rdfs:label "Decent Legibility"@en,
                                  "Leggibilità decente"@it.
ddesc:DecorativeApparatus a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
                            ddesc:IconographicOrDecorativeApparatusType;
                          rdfs:label "Apparato decorativo"@it,
                                     "Decorative apparatus"@en.
ddesc:Dedication a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
                 rdfs:comment "Questa classe rappresenta una dedica, intesa come iscrizione dell'autore (dedicante) su un bene culturale contenente un testo che ha lo scopo di offrire l'oggetto a una persona o un ente (dedicatario)."@it;
                 rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                 rdfs:label "Dedica"@it,
                            "Dedication"@en;
                 rdfs:subClassOf ddesc:Inscription,
                                 [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/context-description/hasCircumstance> ; 
                                  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#allValuesFrom> <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/context-description/Circumstance> ; 
                                  a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>],
                                 [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/context-description/hasSource> ; 
                                  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#allValuesFrom> <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/context-description/Source> ; 
                                  a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>];
                 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                             "stable"@en;
                 <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "ICCD Normativa MI 3.00: AU/DDC".
ddesc:Depth a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
              ddesc:MeasurementType;
            rdfs:label "Depth"@en,
                       "Profondità"@it;
            <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                        "stable"@en.
ddesc:DepthOrHeight a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
                      ddesc:MeasurementType;
                    rdfs:label "Depth / Height"@en,
                               "Profondità / Altezza"@it;
                    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                                "stable"@en.
ddesc:DesignationInTime a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
                        rdfs:comment "This class represents a certain cultural property's designation/denomination attested over time."@en,
                                     "Questa classe rappresenta una denominazione e/o dedicazione attestata nel corso del tempo per il bene in esame. Per la normativa FF, la classe rappresenta nello specifico la denominazione o il titolo del fondo attestati nel corso del tempo per il bene in esame; uno stesso fondo può avere più denominazioni/titoli nel corso del tempo."@it;
                        rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                        rdfs:label "Denominazione nel tempo"@it,
                                   "Designation In Time"@en;
                        rdfs:subClassOf <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/core/Situation>,
                                        [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> ddesc:hasDesignationType ; 
                                         <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#allValuesFrom> ddesc:DesignationType ; 
                                         a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>],
                                        [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/core/note> ; 
                                         <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#allValuesFrom> rdfs:Literal ; 
                                         a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>],
                                        [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#someValuesFrom> rdfs:Literal ; 
                                         <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> <https://w3id.org/italia/onto/l0/name> ; 
                                         a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>],
                                        [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#someValuesFrom> <http://dati.beniculturali.it/cis/CulturalEntity> ; 
                                         <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> ddesc:isDesignationInTimeOf ; 
                                         a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>];
                        <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stable"@en,
                                                                    "stabile"@it;
                        <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "ICCD Normativa Trasversale 4.00: OG/OGD - Normative A, BDM, PG 3: OG/OGA."@it.
ddesc:DesignationType a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
                      rdfs:comment "Questa classe rappresenta il tipo di denominazione o dedicazione o, per la normativa FF, titolo, del bene (altra lingua, attribuita, attuale, dialettale, etc.)"@it,
                                   "This class represents a cultural property's denomination or dedication type, or its title (i.e. other language, current, attributed, dialectal)."@en;
                      rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                      rdfs:label "Tipo di denominazione"@it,
                                 "Designation Type"@en;
                      rdfs:subClassOf <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/core/Type>,
                                      [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#someValuesFrom> ddesc:DesignationInTime ; 
                                       <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> ddesc:isDesignationTypeOf ; 
                                       a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>];
                      <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                                  "stable"@en;
                      <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "ICCD Normativa Trasversale 4.00: OG/OGD/OGDT - Normative A, BDM, PG 3: OGA/OGAG."@it.
ddesc:DialectalDesignation a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
                             ddesc:DesignationType;
                           rdfs:comment "Questo individuo rappresenta una denominazione dialettale."@it,
                                        "This individual represents the dialect designation."@en;
                           rdfs:label "Denominazione dialettale"@it,
                                      "Dialectal designation"@en;
                           <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                                       "stable"@en;
                           <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "ICCD Normativa Trasversale: OGD/OGDT - Normative A e BDM 3: OGA/OGAG."@it.
ddesc:Diameter a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
                 ddesc:MeasurementType;
               rdfs:label "Diameter"@en,
                          "Diametro"@it;
               <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                           "stable"@en.
ddesc:Diapason a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
                 ddesc:TechnicalConcept;
               rdfs:comment "Questo individuo rappresenta il corista rilevato (nota, temperatura ed eventualmente umidità ambientale al momento della rilevazione)."@it,
                            "This individual represents the identified diapason (note, temperature and eventually humidity during the detection)."@en;
               rdfs:label "Corista"@it,
                          "Diapason"@en;
               <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                           "stable"@en;
               <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "ICCD Normativa SM 4.00: AA/AAC".
ddesc:Duration a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
                 ddesc:MeasurementType;
               rdfs:label "Durata temporale"@it,
                          "Duration"@en;
               <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                           "stable"@en.
ddesc:EdgeCircumference a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
                          ddesc:MeasurementType;
                        rdfs:label "Circonferenza orlo"@it,
                                   "Edge circumference"@en;
                        <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                                    "stable"@en.
ddesc:Emblem a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
             rdfs:comment "Questa classe rappresenta un emblema, ovvero una figura o un'immagine simbolica, talvolta accompagnata da un testo scritto (motto, testo in versi, ecc.)"@it;
             rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
             rdfs:label "Emblem"@en,
                        "Emblema"@it;
             rdfs:subClassOf ddesc:AffixedElement;
             <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                         "stable"@en;
             <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "ICCD Normativa Trasversale 4.00: se DA/ISE/ISED = 'emblema' - ICCD versioni precedenti: DA/STM/STMC = 'emblema' - ICCD Normativa A: LI/LSI/LSIG = 'emblema'"@it.
ddesc:Extension a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
                  ddesc:TechnicalConcept;
                rdfs:comment "Questo individuo rappresenta l'estensione musicale di uno strumento musicale."@it,
                             "This individual represents a musical instrument's musical extension."@en;
                rdfs:label "Estensione"@it,
                           "Extension"@en;
                <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                            "stable"@en;
                <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "ICCD Normativa SM 4.00: AA/AAE".
ddesc:ExternalInternalLength a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
                               ddesc:MeasurementType;
                             rdfs:label "External / Internal length"@en,
                                        "Lunghezza esterna / interna"@it;
                             <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                                         "stable"@en.
ddesc:FileFormat a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
                   ddesc:TechnicalConcept;
                 rdfs:comment "Questo individuo rappresenta il formato utilizzato per la scrittura di una risorsa digitale su supporto informatico."@it,
                              "This individual represents the format used to write a digital resource on a data medium."@en;
                 rdfs:label "File Format"@en,
                            "Formato di compressione/estensione file"@it;
                 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                             "stable"@en;
                 <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "ICCD Normativa F: MT/FVC/FVCF".
ddesc:Filigree a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
                 ddesc:TechnicalConcept;
               rdfs:comment "Questo individuo rappresenta la filigrana di un'opera d'arte, un disegno, una fotografia, una stampa."@it,
                            "This individual represents the filigree of an artwork, painting, photography, print."@en;
               rdfs:label "Filigrana"@it,
                          "Filigree"@en;
               <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                           "stable"@en;
               <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "ICCD Normative OA, D, F, S: MT/FIL".
ddesc:FontStyle a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
                rdfs:comment "This class represents the font style used in a text (i.e. italic, bold, gothic)"@en,
                             "Questa classe rappresenta il tipo di caratteri utilizzato in un testo (es.: corsivo, grassetto, caratteri gotici, etc.)"@it;
                rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                rdfs:label "Tipo di caratteri"@it,
                           "Font style"@en;
                rdfs:subClassOf [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#someValuesFrom> ddesc:AffixedElement ; 
                                 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> ddesc:isFontStyleOf ; 
                                 a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>],
                                <https://w3id.org/italia/onto/l0/Characteristic>;
                <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stable"@en,
                                                            "stabile"@it;
                <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "ICCD Normativa Traversale 4.00: DA/ISE/ISET - Normative di versioni precedenti: DA/ISR/ISRT"@it.
ddesc:FrontTotalLength a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
                         ddesc:MeasurementType;
                       rdfs:label "Front total length"@en,
                                  "Lunghezza totale parte anteriore"@it;
                       <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                                   "stable"@en.
ddesc:FunctionalPurpose a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
                        rdfs:comment "This class represents the functional purpose (i.e. decorative, religious, symbolic, magic-offensive) of an object (i.e. culural property or iconographic/decorative apparatus or affixed element on a cultural property like an inscription). The functional purpose is intended as the function that an object has to perform."@en,
                                     "Questa classe rappresenta lo scopo funzionale (decorativo, religioso, simbolico, magico-offensivo, etc.), inteso come funzione che deve svolgere, di un oggetto (es bene culturale, apparato iconografico/decorativo o elemento apposto su un bene culturale come un'iscrizione)."@it;
                        rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                        rdfs:label "Scopo funzionale"@it,
                                   "Functional purpose"@en;
                        rdfs:subClassOf [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#someValuesFrom> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> ; 
                                         <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> ddesc:isFunctionalPurposeOf ; 
                                         a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>],
                                        <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/core/CulturalEntityCharacteristic>;
                        <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                                    "stable"@en;
                        <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "ICCD Normativa Trasversale: DA/ISE/ISEC - Normative di versioni precedenti: DA/ISR/ISRC; DA/APF/APFF - Normative MA e CA: OG/OGT/OGTF"@it.
ddesc:GarmentAnalysis a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
                        ddesc:TechnicalConcept;
                      rdfs:comment "Questo individuo rappresenta la definizione tecnica completa dei tessuti, secondo le norme fornite dal C.I.E.T.A., o dei merletti, oppure rappresenta la distinzione fra tessuto unito e tessuto operato."@it,
                                   "This individual represents the techincal definition of textured fabrics of an ancient or contemporary garment, according to the standard provided by C.I.E.T.A., or laces. It can also represent the dinstrinction between plain fabric and textured fabric."@en;
                      rdfs:label "Analisi del vestimento"@it,
                                 "Garment analysis"@en;
                      <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                                  "stable"@en;
                      <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "ICCD Normativa VeAC: MT/MTC/MTCA".
ddesc:GarmentColour a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
                      ddesc:TechnicalConcept;
                    rdfs:comment "Questo individuo rappresenta il colore dominante, di solito quello del fondo del tessuto, o quello risultante dall'intreccio, di un vestimento antico o contemporaneoi."@it,
                                 "This individual represents the dominant color of a ancient and contemporary garment, usually it is base fabric's color, or the interlaced decoration's color."@en;
                    rdfs:label "Colore del vestimento"@it,
                               "Garment colour"@en;
                    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                                "stable"@en;
                    <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "ICCD Normativa VeAC: MT/MTC/MTCC".
ddesc:GoodConservationStatus a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
                               ddesc:ConservationStatusType;
                             rdfs:label "Good conservation status"@en,
                                        "Stato di conservazione buono"@it;
                             <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                                         "stable"@en.
ddesc:GoodLegibility a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
                       ddesc:Legibility;
                     rdfs:label "Buona leggibilità"@it,
                                "Good legibility"@en.
ddesc:Height a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
               ddesc:MeasurementType;
             rdfs:label "Altezza"@it,
                        "Height"@en;
             <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                         "stable"@en.
ddesc:HeightLength a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
                     ddesc:MeasurementType;
                   rdfs:label "Altezza x Lunghezza"@it,
                              "Height x Length"@en;
                   <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                               "stable"@en.
ddesc:HeightLengthWidth a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
                          ddesc:MeasurementType;
                        rdfs:label "Altezza x Lunghezza x Larghezza"@it,
                                   "Height x Length x Width"@en;
                        <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                                    "stable"@en.
ddesc:HeightWidthThickness a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
                             ddesc:MeasurementType;
                           rdfs:label "Altezza x Larghezza x Spessore"@it,
                                      "Height x Width x Thickness"@en;
                           <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                                       "stable"@en.
ddesc:HipCircumference a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
                         ddesc:MeasurementType;
                       rdfs:label "Circonferenza fianchi"@it,
                                  "Hip circumference"@en;
                       <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                                   "stable"@en.
ddesc:HistoricalDesignation a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
                              ddesc:DesignationType;
                            rdfs:comment "Questo individuo rappresenta una denominazione storica."@it,
                                         "This individual represents a historical designation."@en;
                            rdfs:label "Denominazione storica"@it,
                                       "Historical designation"@en;
                            <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                                        "stable"@en;
                            <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "ICCD Normativa Trasversale: OGD/OGDT - Normative A e PG 3: OGA/OGAG."@it.
ddesc:HistoricalPlaque a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
                       rdfs:comment "Questa classe rappresenta una lapide, intesa come una lastra di pietra o marmo recante iscrizioni, figure, simboli, a scopo commemorativo, celebrativo, ecc."@it;
                       rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                       rdfs:label "Historical Plaque"@en,
                                  "Lapide"@it;
                       rdfs:subClassOf ddesc:AffixedElement;
                       <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                                   "stable"@en;
                       <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "ICCD Normativa A: LI/LSI/LSIG = 'lapide'"@it.
ddesc:IconographicAndDecorativeApparatus a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
                                           ddesc:IconographicOrDecorativeApparatusType;
                                         rdfs:label "Apparato iconografico e decorativo"@it,
                                                    "Iconographic and Decorative apparatus"@en.
ddesc:IconographicApparatus a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
                              ddesc:IconographicOrDecorativeApparatusType;
                            rdfs:label "Apparato iconografico"@it,
                                       "Iconographic apparatus"@en.
ddesc:IconographicOrDecorativeApparatus a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
                                        rdfs:comment "This class represents the iconographic or decorative apparaturs of a cultural property. It is intended as the more or less complex set of iconographic or decorative representations on the cultural property."@en,
                                                     "Questa classe rappresenta l'apparato iconografico e/o decorativo di un bene culturale, inteso come l'insieme, che può essere più o meno complesso, delle rappresentazioni iconografiche e/o delle decorazioni presenti sul bene."@it;
                                        rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                                        rdfs:label "Apparato iconografico e decorativo"@it,
                                                   "Iconographic or Decorative Apparatus"@en;
                                        rdfs:subClassOf [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> ddesc:hasFunctionalPurpose ; 
                                                         <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#allValuesFrom> ddesc:FunctionalPurpose ; 
                                                         a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>],
                                                        [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#someValuesFrom> <http://dati.beniculturali.it/cis/CulturalEntity> ; 
                                                         <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> ddesc:isIconographicOrDecorativeApparatusOf ; 
                                                         a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>],
                                                        [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#someValuesFrom> ddesc:IconographicOrDecorativeApparatusType ; 
                                                         <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> ddesc:hasIconographicOrDecorativeApparatusType ; 
                                                         a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>],
                                                        <https://w3id.org/italia/onto/l0/Description>,
                                                        [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> ddesc:hasOrnamentalMotif ; 
                                                         <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#allValuesFrom> ddesc:OrnamentalMotif ; 
                                                         a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>];
                                        <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                                                    "stable"@en;
                                        <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "ICCD Normativa Trasversale 4.00: DA/AID - ICCD Normative PST e BDM: DA/APF".
ddesc:IconographicOrDecorativeApparatusType a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
                                            rdfs:comment "Questa classe rappresenta il tipo (iconografico, decorativo, iconografico-decorativo) di apparato iconografico e decorativo di un bene culturale."@it,
                                                         "This class represents the iconographic or decorative apparatus' type (iconographic, decorative, iconographic-decorative) of a cultual property."@en;
                                            rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                                            rdfs:label "Iconographic Or Decorative Apparatus Type"@en,
                                                       "Tipo di apparato iconografico e decorativo"@it;
                                            rdfs:subClassOf <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/core/Type>,
                                                            [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#someValuesFrom> ddesc:IconographicOrDecorativeApparatus ; 
                                                             <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> ddesc:isIconographicOrDecorativeApparatusTypeOf ; 
                                                             a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>];
                                            <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stable"@en,
                                                                                        "stabile"@it;
                                            <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "ICCD Normativa Trasversale 4.00: DA/AID/AIDO".
ddesc:IdiomaticDesignation a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
                             ddesc:DesignationType;
                           rdfs:comment "Questo individuo rappresenta una denominazione idiomatica."@it,
                                        "This individual represents an idiomatic designation."@en;
                           rdfs:label "Denominazione idiomatica"@it,
                                      "Idiomatic designation"@en;
                           <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                                       "stable"@en;
                           <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "ICCD Normativa Trasversale: OGD/OGDT - Normative A e PG 3: OGA/OGAG."@it.
ddesc:ImplementationMethod a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
                           rdfs:comment "Questa classe rappresenta la modalità esecutiva (es.: alternanza, polifonia) associata a una modalità comunicativa (verbale, musicale vocale, musicale strumentale)."@it,
                                        "This class represents the implementation method (e.g.: polyphonic) associated to a verbale or singing or instrumental communication medium."@en;
                           rdfs:label "Modalità esecutiva"@it,
                                      "Implementation method"@en;
                           rdfs:subClassOf [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#someValuesFrom> ddesc:CommunicationMedium ; 
                                            <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> ddesc:isImplementationMethodOf ; 
                                            a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>],
                                           <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/core/Method>;
                           <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                                       "stable"@en;
                           <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "ICCD Normativa BDI: CU/CUM/CUMD; CU/CUS/CUSD".
ddesc:ImpossibleLegibility a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
                             ddesc:Legibility;
                           rdfs:label "Impossible legibility"@en,
                                      "Leggibilità assente"@it.
ddesc:Inaccessible a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
                     ddesc:CulturalPropertyAccessibility;
                   rdfs:label "Inaccessibile"@it,
                              "Inaccessible"@en.
ddesc:Inscription a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
                  rdfs:comment "Questa classe rappresenta un'iscrizione, ovvero qualsiasi scritta o segno grafico volontario, realizzati con qualsiasi tecnica (incisione, pittura, stampa, ecc.)"@it;
                  rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                  rdfs:label "Inscription"@en,
                             "Iscrizione"@it;
                  rdfs:subClassOf ddesc:AffixedElement;
                  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                              "stable"@en;
                  <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "ICCD Normativa Trasversale 4.00: se DA/ISE/ISED = 'iscrizione' - ICCD versioni precedenti: DA/ISR - ICCD Normativa A: LI/LSI/LSIG = 'iscrizione'"@it.
ddesc:InstrumentalCommunication a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
                                  ddesc:CommunicationMediumType;
                                rdfs:label "Comunicazione musicale strumentale"@it,
                                           "Instrumental communication"@en.
ddesc:KinesicCommunication a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
                             ddesc:CommunicationMediumType;
                           rdfs:label "Comunicazione cinesica"@it,
                                      "Kinesic communication"@en.
ddesc:Legibility a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
                 rdfs:comment "Questa classe rappresenta lo stato di leggibilità (totale, buona, discreta, ridotta, assente) di un bene numismatico, relativamente al suo stato di conservazione."@it,
                              "This class represents the legibility status (complete, decent, good, lowered, impossible) of a numinsmatic property. It is related to the property's conservation status."@en;
                 rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                 rdfs:label "Legibility"@en,
                            "Leggibilità"@it;
                 rdfs:subClassOf [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#someValuesFrom> ddesc:ConservationStatus ; 
                                  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> ddesc:isLegibilityOf ; 
                                  a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>],
                                 <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/core/CulturalEntityCharacteristic>;
                 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stable"@en,
                                                             "stabile"@it;
                 <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "ICCD Normativa NU: CO/STC/STCL".
ddesc:Length a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
               ddesc:MeasurementType;
             rdfs:label "Length"@en,
                        "Lunghezza"@it;
             <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                         "stable"@en.
ddesc:LocalDesignation a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
                         ddesc:DesignationType;
                       rdfs:comment "Questo individuo rappresenta una denominazione locale."@it,
                                    "This individual represents an local designation."@en;
                       rdfs:label "Denominazione locale"@it,
                                  "Local designation"@en;
                       <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                                   "stable"@en;
                       <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "ICCD Normativa Trasversale: OGD/OGDT - Normative A e BDM 3: OGA/OGAG."@it.
ddesc:Logo a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
           rdfs:comment """Questa classe rappresenta un logo, ovvero, in ambito commerciale e pubblicitario, scritta e/o simbolo grafico che identifica un prodotto,
un'azienda, ecc."""@it;
           rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
           rdfs:label "Logo"@en,
                      "Logo"@it;
           rdfs:subClassOf ddesc:AffixedElement;
           <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                       "stable"@en;
           <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "ICCD Normativa Trasversale 4.00: se DA/ISE/ISED = 'logo' - ICCD versioni precedenti: DA/STM/STMC = 'logo' - ICCD Normativa A: LI/LSI/LSIG = 'logo'".
ddesc:LoweredLegibility a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
                          ddesc:Legibility;
                        rdfs:label "Leggibilità ridotta"@it,
                                   "Lowered legibility"@en.
ddesc:MassStorage a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
                    ddesc:TechnicalConcept;
                  rdfs:comment "Questo individuo rappresenta la memoria di massa nella quale è stata memorizzata una fotografia digitale."@it,
                               "This individual represents the mass storage where a digital photograph is stored."@en;
                  rdfs:label "Mass storage"@en,
                             "Memoria di massa"@it;
                  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                              "stable"@en;
                  <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "ICCD Normativa F: MT/FVM".
ddesc:Material a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
                 ddesc:TechnicalConcept;
               rdfs:comment "Questo individuo rappresenta la materia con cui è realizzato un oggetto, per esempio un bene culturale."@it,
                            "This individual represents the material through which an object has been realized, e.g. a cultural entity."@en;
               rdfs:label "Materia"@it,
                          "Material"@en;
               <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                           "stable"@en;
               <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "ICCD Normativa Trasversale 4.00: MT/MTC/MTCM; ICCD Normativa VeAC: MT/MTC/MTCF".
ddesc:MaterialOrTechnique a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
                            ddesc:TechnicalConcept;
                          rdfs:comment """Questo individuo rappresenta la materia e/o la tecnica con cui è realizzato un oggetto, per esempio un bene culturale. Nel dominio delle normative  ICCD per la catalogazione dei beni culturali, si rende necessario nei casi in cui materia e tecnica sono registrate nello stesso campo, nella forma \"materia/ tecnica\"."""@it,
                                       "This individual represents the material or technique through which an object has been realized, e.g. a cultural entity. In ICCD standard for cataloguing cultural entities, this label is necessary when material and techinque are registered in the same field."@en;
                          rdfs:label "Materia o tecnica"@it,
                                     "Material or Technique"@en;
                          <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                                      "stable"@en;
                          <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "MT/MTC (come campo semplice)"@it.
ddesc:MaximumMinimumWidth a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
                            ddesc:MeasurementType;
                          rdfs:label "Larghezza massima / minima"@it,
                                     "Maximum / minimum width"@en;
                          <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                                      "stable"@en.
ddesc:MaximumTotalLength a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
                           ddesc:MeasurementType;
                         rdfs:label "Lunghezza totale massima"@it,
                                    "Maximum total length"@en;
                         <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                                     "stable"@en.
ddesc:MaximumTotalWidth a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
                          ddesc:MeasurementType;
                        rdfs:label "Larghezza totale massima"@it,
                                   "Maximum total width"@en;
                        <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                                    "stable"@en.
ddesc:Measurement <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/description> """Un esempio d'uso della classe \"Misura\" è il seguente:
resource:Measurement/0500212021-1-height
        a  dd:Measurement ;
        rdfs:label  \"Misura del bene culturale 0500212021: 795mm.\"@it ;
        dd:hasMeasurementType dd:Height ;
        dd:hasValue resource:Value/0500212021-1-height-795 ."""@it,
                                                                """An example of usage of the class 'Measurement' is the following:
resource:Measurement/0500212021-1-height
        a  dd:Measurement ;
        rdfs:label  \"Measurement of cultural property 0500212021: 795mm.\"@en ;
        dd:hasMeasurementType dd:Height ;
        dd:hasValue resource:Value/0500212021-1-height-795 ."""@en;
                  a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
                  rdfs:comment "Questa classe rappresenta una misura osservata per un oggetto. Le misure sono relative alle dimensioni del bene in esame. Per la normativa F, le misure possono essere relative anche a supporti secondari, custodie, cornici, singoli fotogrammi, ecc. Per la normativa VeAC, le misure possono essere relative all'ingombro per l'immagazzinaggio; alla base (individuano l'oggetto e la conformazione fisica del proprietario e sono fondamentali per l'allestimento museale, per individuare i tipi di supporti necessari per l'esposizione); alle maniche."@it,
                               "This class represents a measurement of an object. Measurements realte to the cultural property's dimensions."@en;
                  rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                  rdfs:label "Measurement"@en,
                             "Misura"@it;
                  rdfs:subClassOf [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#someValuesFrom> ddesc:MeasurementType ; 
                                   <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> ddesc:hasMeasurementType ; 
                                   a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>],
                                  [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#someValuesFrom> <https://w3id.org/italia/onto/MU/Value> ; 
                                   <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> ddesc:hasValue ; 
                                   a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>],
                                  [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#someValuesFrom> ddesc:MeasurementCollection ; 
                                   <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> ddesc:isMeasurementIn ; 
                                   a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>],
                                  <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/core/Situation>;
                  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stable"@en,
                                                              "stabile"@it;
                  <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "MT/MIS"@it.
ddesc:MeasurementCollection <http://ontologydesignpatterns.org/opla/isNativeTo> <https://w3id.org/arco/pattern/object-collection/>;
                            <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/description> """An example of usage of the class 'Measurement collection' is the following:
resource:MeasurementCollection/1200865132-1
        a  dd:MeasurementCollection ;
        rdfs:label \"Measurements of cultural property 1200865132 7\"@en ;
        dd:hasMeasurement resource:Measurement/1200865132-1-width , resource:Measurement/1200865132-1-height , resource:Measurement/1200865132-1-depth ."""@en,
                                                                          """Un esempio d'uso della classe \"Collezione di misure\" è il seguente:
resource:MeasurementCollection/1200865132-1
        a  dd:MeasurementCollection ;
        rdfs:label \"Misure del bene culturale 1200865132 7\"@it ;
        dd:hasMeasurement resource:Measurement/1200865132-1-width , resource:Measurement/1200865132-1-height , resource:Measurement/1200865132-1-depth ."""@it;
                            a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
                            rdfs:comment "Questa classe rappresenta l'insieme delle misurazioni osservate per un oggetto. Per la normativa F, le misure possono essere relative anche a supporti secondari, custodie, cornici, singoli fotogrammi, ecc. Per la normativa VeAC, le misure possono essere relative all'ingombro per l'immagazzinaggio; alla base (individuano l'oggetto e la conformazione fisica del proprietario e sono fondamentali per l'allestimento museale, per individuare i tipi di supporti necessari per l'esposizione); alle maniche."@it,
                                         "This class represents the set of measurments observed for an object."@en;
                            rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                            rdfs:label "Measurement collection"@en,
                                       "Collezione di misure"@it;
                            rdfs:subClassOf [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#someValuesFrom> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> ; 
                                             <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> ddesc:isMeasurementCollectionOf ; 
                                             a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>],
                                            <https://w3id.org/italia/onto/l0/Collection>,
                                            [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#someValuesFrom> ddesc:Measurement ; 
                                             <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> ddesc:hasMeasurement ; 
                                             a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>];
                            <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                                        "stable"@en;
                            <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "MT/MIS - Normativa VeAC: anche MT/MII e MT/MIM"@it.
ddesc:MeasurementType a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
                      rdfs:comment "Questa classe rappresenta il tipo di misura osservata (larghezza, altezza, diametro, etc.)"@it,
                                   "This class represents the observed measurement type (width, height, diameter, etc)."@en;
                      rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                      rdfs:label "Tipo di Misura"@it,
                                 "Measurement Type"@en;
                      rdfs:subClassOf [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#someValuesFrom> ddesc:Measurement ; 
                                       <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> ddesc:isMeasurementTypeOf ; 
                                       a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>],
                                      <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/core/Type>;
                      <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stable"@en,
                                                                  "stabile"@it;
                      <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "ICCD Normativa Trasversale: MT/MIS/MISZ; MT/MNR - Per versioni di normativa precedenti alla 4.00: MT/MIS/MISA; MT/MIS/MISD; MT/MIS/MISL; MT/MIS/MISN; MT/MIS/MISG; MT/MIS/MISP; MT/MIS/MISS; MT/MIS/MISR; MT/MIS/MISV - ICCD scheda VeAC: MT/MII/MIIA; MT/MII/MIIL; MT/MII/MIIP; MT/MIS/MISR; MT/MIS/MISD; MT/MIS/MISS; MT/MIS/MISP; MT/MIS/MISV; MT/MIS/MISF; MT/MIS/MISO"@it.
ddesc:MediocreConservationStatus a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
                                   ddesc:ConservationStatusType;
                                 rdfs:label "Mediocre conservation status"@en,
                                            "Stato di conservazione mediocre"@it;
                                 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                                             "stable"@en.
ddesc:NoLongerAvailable a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
                          ddesc:CulturalPropertyAvailability;
                        rdfs:label "No longer available"@en,
                                   "Non più disponibile"@it.
ddesc:OccupiedStorageSpace a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
                             ddesc:MeasurementType;
                           rdfs:label "Memoria occupata"@it,
                                      "Occupied storage space"@en;
                           <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                                       "stable"@en.
ddesc:Orientation a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
                  rdfs:comment "This class represents the orientation of an object (i.e. N.W., S.E.), considering the main axis."@en,
                               "Questa classe rappresenta l'orientamento di un oggetto (NO, SE, etc.), secondo l'asse principale individuato."@it;
                  rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                  rdfs:label "Orientation"@en,
                             "Orientamento"@it;
                  rdfs:subClassOf [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#someValuesFrom> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> ; 
                                   <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> ddesc:isOrientationOf ; 
                                   a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>],
                                  <https://w3id.org/italia/onto/l0/Characteristic>;
                  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stable"@en,
                                                              "stabile"@it;
                  <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "ICCD Normativa Trasversale: MT/ORT - ICCD Schede CA e MA: MT/ORT"@it.
ddesc:OriginalDesignation a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
                            ddesc:DesignationType;
                          rdfs:comment "Questo individuo rappresenta una denominazione originaria."@it,
                                       "This individual represents original designation."@en;
                          rdfs:label "Denominazione originaria"@it,
                                     "Original designation"@en;
                          <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                                      "stable"@en;
                          <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "ICCD Normativa Trasversale: OGD/OGDT - Normative A e PG 3: OGA/OGAG."@it.
ddesc:OrnamentalMotif a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
                      rdfs:comment "This class represents the ornamental motif (anthropomorphous, zoomorphic, geometric) represented by a cultural property's iconographic and decorative apparatus."@en,
                                   "Questa classe rappresenta il motivo decorativo (antropomorfo, zoomorfo, geometrico) rappresentato da un apparato iconografico e decorativo di un bene culturale."@it;
                      rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                      rdfs:label "Motivo decorativo"@it,
                                 "Ornamental Motif"@en;
                      rdfs:subClassOf <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/core/Concept>,
                                      [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#someValuesFrom> ddesc:IconographicOrDecorativeApparatus ; 
                                       <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> ddesc:isOrnamentalMotifOf ; 
                                       a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>];
                      <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                                  "stable"@en.
ddesc:OtherLanguageDesignation a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
                                 ddesc:DesignationType;
                               rdfs:comment "Questo individuo rappresenta una denominazione in altra lingua."@it,
                                            "This individual represents a designation in other language."@en;
                               rdfs:label "Denominazione in altra lingua"@it,
                                          "Other language designation"@en;
                               <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                                           "stable"@en;
                               <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "ICCD Normativa Trasversale: OGD/OGDT - Normative A, BDM, PG 3: OGA/OGAG."@it.
ddesc:PartiallyAccessible a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
                            ddesc:CulturalPropertyAccessibility;
                          rdfs:label "Partially accessible"@en,
                                     "Parzialmente accessibile"@it.
ddesc:Perimeter a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
                  ddesc:MeasurementType;
                rdfs:label "Perimeter"@en,
                           "Perimetro"@it;
                <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                            "stable"@en.
ddesc:PhotoColour a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
                    ddesc:TechnicalConcept;
                  rdfs:comment "Questo individuo rappresenta il colore della fotografia digitale, ovvero se trattasi di fotografia in bianco/nero o a colori."@it,
                               "This individual represents a digital photograph's colour, i.e. black and white or colours."@en;
                  rdfs:label "Colore della fotografia"@it,
                             "Photo colour"@en;
                  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                              "stable"@en;
                  <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "ICCD Normativa F: MT/MTX".
ddesc:PhotoProgram a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
                     ddesc:TechnicalConcept;
                   rdfs:comment "Questo individuo rappresenta il programma di visualizzazione, memorizzazione ed elaborazione utilizzato per la fotografia digitale."@it,
                                "This individual represents the visualization, storage and processing program used for a digital photograph."@en;
                   rdfs:label "Photo program"@en,
                              "Programma per la fotografia digitale"@it;
                   <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                               "stable"@en;
                   <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "ICCD Normativa F: MT/FVC/FVCP".
ddesc:PhotoSize a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
                  ddesc:TechnicalConcept;
                rdfs:comment "Questo individuo rappresenta il formato di una fotografia digitale, inteso come la dimensione standardizzata dei materiali fotografici (negativi, positivi, ecc.)."@it,
                             "This individual represents a digital photograph format, intended as the photogrphic material's standardised size (e.g. negative, positives)."@en;
                rdfs:label "Dimensioni della foto (Formato)"@it,
                           "Photo size"@en;
                <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                            "stable"@en;
                <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "ICCD Normativa F: MT/FRM".
ddesc:PixelDimension a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
                       ddesc:TechnicalConcept;
                     rdfs:comment "Questo individuo rappresenta le dimensioni, in pixel, di una fotografia digitale."@it,
                                  "This individual represents a digital photograph size in pixels."@en;
                     rdfs:label "Dimensioni in pixel"@it,
                                "Pixel dimension"@en;
                     <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                                 "stable"@en;
                     <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "ICCD Normativa F: MT/FVC/FVCM".
ddesc:Power a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
              ddesc:MeasurementType;
            rdfs:label "Potenza"@it,
                       "Power"@en;
            <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                        "stable"@en.
ddesc:ProxemicsCommunication a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
                               ddesc:CommunicationMediumType;
                             rdfs:label "Comunicazione prossemica"@it,
                                        "Proxemics communication"@en.
ddesc:QualityLevel a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
                     ddesc:TechnicalConcept;
                   rdfs:comment "Questo individuo rappresenta il livello di qualità di una risorsa digitale (es.: alta risoluzione, bassa risoluzione, preview)"@it,
                                "This individual represents a digital resource's quality level, e.g. high-resolution, low-resolution, preview."@en;
                   rdfs:label "Livello di qualità"@it,
                              "Quality level"@en.
ddesc:Resolution a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
                   ddesc:TechnicalConcept;
                 rdfs:comment "Questo individuo rappresenta la risoluzione e il valore specifico utilizzati per la memorizzazione di una fotografia digitale."@it,
                              "This individual represents the specific value and resolution used for storing a digital photograph."@en;
                 rdfs:label "Resolution"@en,
                            "Risoluzione"@it;
                 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                             "stable"@en;
                 <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "ICCD Normativa F: MT/FVC/FVCU".
ddesc:SampleCollected a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
                      rdfs:comment "This class represents a sample collected from an archeological property."@en,
                                   "Questa classe rappresenta un campione prelevato da un bene archeologico."@it;
                      rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                      rdfs:label "Campione prelevato"@it,
                                 "Sample collected"@en;
                      rdfs:subClassOf [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> ddesc:positionOnCulturalProperty ; 
                                       <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#allValuesFrom> rdfs:Literal ; 
                                       a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>],
                                      [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> ddesc:sampleCollectedIdentifier ; 
                                       <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#allValuesFrom> rdfs:Literal ; 
                                       a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>],
                                      [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> ddesc:hasSampleCollectedType ; 
                                       <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#allValuesFrom> ddesc:SampleCollectedType ; 
                                       a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>],
                                      <https://w3id.org/italia/onto/l0/Collection>,
                                      [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#someValuesFrom> <http://dati.beniculturali.it/cis/CulturalEntity> ; 
                                       <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> ddesc:isSampleCollectedFrom ; 
                                       a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>];
                      <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stable"@en,
                                                                  "stabile"@it;
                      <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "ICCD Normativa MA, CA, SI, SAS: MC/CMN".
ddesc:SampleCollectedType a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
                          rdfs:comment "This class represents the sample type collected from an archaeologiacal property (i.e. coal, pottery, grout)"@en,
                                       "Questa classe rappresenta il tipo di campione prelevato da un bene archeologico (es.: carbone, ceramica, intonaco, etc.)"@it;
                          rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                          rdfs:label "Sample collected type"@en,
                                     "Tipo di campione prelevato"@it;
                          rdfs:subClassOf <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/core/Type>,
                                          [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#someValuesFrom> ddesc:SampleCollected ; 
                                           <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> ddesc:isSampleCollectedTypeOf ; 
                                           a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>];
                          <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                                      "stable"@en;
                          <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "ICCD Normativa MA, CA, SI, SAS: MC/CMN/CMNT".
ddesc:Shape a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
              ddesc:TechnicalConcept;
            rdfs:comment "Questo individuo rappresenta la forma di un oggetto, per oggetti bidimensionali (es.: ottagonale, tondo)"@it,
                         "This individual represents an object's shape. It is used for bidimensional objects, e.g. octagonal or round shape."@en;
            rdfs:label "Formato"@it,
                       "Shape"@en;
            <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                        "stable"@en;
            <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "ICCD Normative OA, D, S, MI: MT/FRM".
ddesc:SingingCommunication a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
                             ddesc:CommunicationMediumType;
                           rdfs:label "Comunicazione musicale vocale"@it,
                                      "Singing communication"@en.
ddesc:SlangDesignation a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
                         ddesc:DesignationType;
                       rdfs:comment "Questo individuo rappresenta una denominazione gergale."@it,
                                    "This individual represents a slang designation."@en;
                       rdfs:label "Denominazione gergale"@it,
                                  "Slang designation"@en;
                       <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                                   "stable"@en;
                       <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "ICCD Normativa Trasversale: OGD/OGDT - Normative A e BDM 3: OGA/OGAG."@it.
ddesc:Stamp a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
            rdfs:comment "Questa classe rappresenta il segno impresso con un timbro, ovvero uno strumento di gomma o di metallo per imprimere segni a inchiostro oppure a secco."@it;
            rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
            rdfs:label "Stamp"@en,
                       "Timbro"@it;
            rdfs:subClassOf ddesc:AffixedElement;
            <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                        "stable"@en;
            <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "ICCD Normativa Trasversale 4.00: se DA/ISE/ISED = 'timbro' - ICCD versioni precedenti: DA/STM/STMC = 'timbro' - ICCD Normativa A: LI/LSI/LSIG = 'timbro'"@it.
ddesc:StorageCapacity a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
                        ddesc:MeasurementType;
                      rdfs:label "Capacità di memoria"@it,
                                 "Storage capacity"@en;
                      <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                                  "stable"@en.
ddesc:StorageMethodColourDepth a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
                                 ddesc:TechnicalConcept;
                               rdfs:comment "Questo individuo rappresenta il metodo e la profondità di colore con cui è stata memorizzata la fotografia digitale."@it,
                                            "This individual represents the method and color depth through which a digital photograph has been stored."@en;
                               rdfs:label "Metodo di memorizzazione e profondità di colore"@it,
                                          "Storage method and colour depth"@en;
                               <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                                           "stable"@en;
                               <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "ICCD Normativa F: MT/FVC/FVCC".
ddesc:Support a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
              rdfs:comment """Questa classe rappresenta il supporto sul quale può trovarsi un elemento, per esempio un'iscrizione, un emblema, un timbro, etc., rappresentati su un bene culturale (es. \"etichetta di carta\")."""@it,
                           """This class represents the support on which an element can be located, for instance an inscription, emblem, postmark represented on a cultural property (i.e. \"paper label\")."""@en;
              rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
              rdfs:label "Supporto"@it,
                         "Support"@en;
              rdfs:subClassOf [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#someValuesFrom> ddesc:AffixedElement ; 
                               <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> ddesc:isSupportOf ; 
                               a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>],
                              <https://w3id.org/italia/onto/l0/Object>;
              <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                          "stable"@en;
              <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "ICCD Normativa Trasversale 4.00: DA/ISE/ISES".
ddesc:TechnicalCharacteristic <http://ontologydesignpatterns.org/opla/isNativeTo> <https://w3id.org/arco/pattern/technical-characteristic/>;
                              a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
                              rdfs:comment """This class represents a characteristic of a cultural property. For example it can represent a cultural property's particular costituent material or the technique with which it was made or its shape or color. Each technical characteristic is classified by a concept (i.e. \"clay\" is a techical characteristic classified by the technical concept \"material\" related to a cultural property). For each cultural property typology can be registered some specific technical characteristics."""@en,
                                           """Questa classe rappresenta una caratteristica tecnica relativa a un bene culturale. Per esempio, può rappresentare una particolare materia di cui è composto, la tecnica con cui è stato realizzato, la sua forma, il suo colore. Ogni caratteristica tecnica utilizza è definito da un concetto (es.: \"terracotta\" è una caratteristica tecnica definita dal concetto \"materia\", relativamente a un bene culturale). Per ogni tipologia di bene culturale possono essere rilevati e registrate caratteristiche tecnice specifiche."""@it;
                              rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                              rdfs:label "Caratteristica tecnica"@it,
                                         "Technical Characteristic"@en;
                              rdfs:subClassOf <https://w3id.org/italia/onto/l0/Characteristic>,
                                              [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> ddesc:isCharacteristicClassifiedBy ; 
                                               <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#allValuesFrom> ddesc:TechnicalConcept ; 
                                               a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>],
                                              [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> ddesc:isIncludedInTechnicalStatus ; 
                                               <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#allValuesFrom> ddesc:CulturalEntityTechnicalStatus ; 
                                               a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>];
                              <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stable"@en,
                                                                          "stabile"@it;
                              <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "ICCD Normativa Trasversale 4.00: MT/MTC/MTCM; MT/MTC/MTCT - Normativa OA, D, F, S, MI: MT/FRM - Normativa OA, D, F, S: MT/FIL - Normativa VeAC: MT/MTC/MTCC; MT/MTC/MTCF - Normativa F: MT/FVC/FVCC; MT/FVC/FVCF; MT/FVC/FVCP; MT/FVC/FVCU; MT/FVC/FVCM; MT/FVM;".
ddesc:TechnicalConcept <http://ontologydesignpatterns.org/opla/isNativeTo> <https://w3id.org/arco/pattern/technical-characteristic/>;
                       a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
                       rdfs:comment """This class represents a technical concept, a particular type of concept that classifies a technical characteristic of an entity, e.g. cultural property. For instance, \"material\" is a techincal concept that classifies the technical characteristic \"pottery\" related to a cultural property."""@en,
                                    """Questa classe rappresenta un concetto tecnico, inteso come tipo particolare di concetto che fornisce una classificazione a una caratteristica tecnica di un'entità, es. un bene culturale. Per esempio, \"materia\" è un concetto tecnico che può essere utilizzato per classificare la caratteristica tecnica \"terracotta\" relativa a un bene culturale."""@it;
                       rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                       rdfs:label "Concetto tecnico"@it,
                                  "Technical concept"@en;
                       rdfs:subClassOf <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/core/Concept>;
                       <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                                   "stable"@en;
                       <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "ICCD Normativa Trasversale 4.00: MT/MTC/MTCM; MT/MTC/MTCT - Normativa OA, D, S, MI: MT/FRM - Normativa OA, D, F, S: MT/FIL - Normativa VeAC: MT/MTC/MTCC; MT/MTC/MTCF - Normativa F: MT/FVC/FVCC; MT/FVC/FVCF; MT/FVC/FVCP; MT/FVC/FVCU; MT/FVC/FVCM; MT/FVM; MT/MTX; MT/FVM; MT/FRM;".
ddesc:Technique a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
                  ddesc:TechnicalConcept;
                rdfs:comment "Questo individuo rappresenta la tecnica di esecuzione di un oggetto, per esempio un bene culturale."@it,
                             "This individual represents an object's execution technique."@en;
                rdfs:label "Technique"@en,
                           "Tecnica"@it;
                <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                            "stable"@en;
                <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "ICCD Normativa Trasversale 4.00: MT/MTC/MTCT".
ddesc:Temperament a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
                    ddesc:TechnicalConcept;
                  rdfs:comment "Questo individuo rappresenta il temperamento adottato, soprattutto in caso di oggetto in condizioni originali, o dopo un restauro, di uno strumento musicale. Per gli idiofoni a tasti fissi (come xilofoni, litofoni, metallofoni) rappresenta la successione degli intervalli."@it,
                               "This individual represents a musical instrument adopted temperament, especially in relation to an object in its original conditions, or after its restoration. For idiophones with fixed keys (e.g. xylophone, litophone, metallophone) the temperament represents the succession of intervals."@en;
                  rdfs:label "Temperament"@en,
                             "Temperamento"@it;
                  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                              "stable"@en;
                  <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "ICCD Normativa SM 4.00: AA/AAP".
ddesc:Thickness a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
                  ddesc:MeasurementType;
                rdfs:label "Spessore"@it,
                           "Thickness"@en;
                <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                            "stable"@en.
ddesc:Tuning a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
               ddesc:TechnicalConcept;
             rdfs:comment "Questo individuo rappresenta l'accordatura di uno strumento musicale."@it,
                          "This individual represents a musical instrument tuning."@en;
             rdfs:label "Accordatura"@it,
                        "Tuning"@en;
             <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                         "stable"@en;
             <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "ICCD Normativa SM 4.00: AA/AAA".
ddesc:UnavailableConservationStatus a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
                                      ddesc:ConservationStatusType;
                                    rdfs:label "Data on conservation status unavailable"@en,
                                               "Dato sullo stato di conservazione non disponibile"@it;
                                    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                                                "stable"@en.
ddesc:UndetectedMeasurements a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
                               ddesc:MeasurementType;
                             <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "Misure non rilevate"@it,
                                                                         "Undetected Measurements"@en,
                                                                         "stabile"@it,
                                                                         "stable"@en.
ddesc:VariousMeasurements a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
                            ddesc:MeasurementType;
                          rdfs:label "Misure varie"@it,
                                     "Various misurements"@en;
                          <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                                      "stable"@en.
ddesc:VerbalCommunication a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
                            ddesc:CommunicationMediumType;
                          rdfs:label "Comunicazione verbale"@it,
                                     "Verbal communication"@en.
ddesc:VibratingLenght a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
                        ddesc:TechnicalConcept;
                      rdfs:comment "Questo individuo rappresenta la lunghezza vibrante di uno strumento, in particolare di un cordofono."@it,
                                   "This individual represents a musical instrument vibrating length, in particular a chordophone."@en;
                      rdfs:label "Lunghezza vibrante"@it,
                                 "Vibrating lenght"@en;
                      <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                                  "stable"@en;
                      <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "ICCD Normativa SM 4.00: AA/AAL".
ddesc:Volume a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
               ddesc:MeasurementType;
             rdfs:label "Volume"@en,
                        "Volume"@it;
             <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                         "stable"@en.
ddesc:VolumetricDiamensions a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
                              ddesc:MeasurementType;
                            rdfs:label "Ingombro"@it,
                                       "Volumetric dimensions"@en;
                            <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                                        "stable"@en.
ddesc:WaistCircumference a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
                           ddesc:MeasurementType;
                         rdfs:label "Circonferenza vita"@it,
                                    "Waist Circumference"@en;
                         <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                                     "stable"@en.
ddesc:Weight a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
               ddesc:MeasurementType;
             rdfs:label "Peso"@it,
                        "Weight"@en;
             <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                         "stable"@en.
ddesc:Width a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
              ddesc:MeasurementType;
            rdfs:label "Larghezza"@it,
                       "Width"@en;
            <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                        "stable"@en.
ddesc:WritingSystem a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
                    rdfs:comment "Questa classe rappresenta il sistema di scrittura/alfabeto adottati in una iscrizione, un timbro, uno stemma, etc."@it,
                                 "This class represents the writing system or alphabet of an inscription, postmark, crest etc."@en;
                    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                    rdfs:label "Sistema di scrittura"@it,
                               "Writing system"@en;
                    rdfs:subClassOf <https://w3id.org/italia/onto/l0/System>,
                                    [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#someValuesFrom> ddesc:AffixedElement ; 
                                     <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> ddesc:isWritingSystemOf ; 
                                     a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>];
                    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stable"@en,
                                                                "stabile"@it;
                    <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "ICCD Normativa Trasversale 4.00: DA/ISE/ISEF".
ddesc:WrittenCommunication a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
                             ddesc:CommunicationMediumType;
                           rdfs:label "Comunicazione scritta"@it,
                                      "Written communication"@en.
ddesc:anthropologicalMaterialMorphology a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty>,
                                          <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty>;
                                        rdfs:comment "Questa proprietà rappresenta la morfologia di un reperto antropologico (es.: morfologia naturale; morfologia alterata intra-vitam per cause naturali e/o per intervento antropico; morfologia/ struttura alterata post-mortem per cause naturali)."@it,
                                                     "This property represents the morphology of an anthropological material."@en;
                                        rdfs:domain <http://dati.beniculturali.it/cis/CulturalEntity>;
                                        rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                                        rdfs:label "morfologia di reperto antropologico"@it,
                                                   "anthropological material morphology"@en;
                                        rdfs:range rdfs:Literal;
                                        <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stable"@en,
                                                                                    "stabile"@it;
                                        <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "ICCD Normativa AT 3.01: OG/OGT/OGTM".
ddesc:areAvailableNotesOf a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
                          rdfs:comment """Questa è la proprietà inversa di \"ha note producibili\"."""@it,
                                       """This is the inverse property of \"has available notes\"."""@en;
                          rdfs:domain ddesc:TechnicalCharacteristic;
                          rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                          rdfs:label "sono note producibili di"@it,
                                     "are available notes of"@en;
                          rdfs:range <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing>;
                          rdfs:subPropertyOf ddesc:isTechnicalCharacteristicOf;
                          <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> ddesc:hasAvailableNotes;
                          <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stable"@en,
                                                                      "stabile"@it.
ddesc:classifiesCharacteristic <http://ontologydesignpatterns.org/opla/isNativeTo> <https://w3id.org/arco/pattern/technical-characteristic/>;
                               a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
                               rdfs:comment """Questa proprietà, inversa a \"è caratteristica classificata da\", collega un concetto tecnico a una caratteristica tecnica di un'entità - come un bene culturale."""@it,
                                            "This property connects a techical concept to an entity's technical characteristic. It is the inverse property of isCharacteristicClassifiedBy."@en;
                               rdfs:domain ddesc:TechnicalConcept;
                               rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                               rdfs:label "classifies technical characteristic"@en,
                                          "classifica caratteristica tecnica"@it;
                               rdfs:range ddesc:TechnicalCharacteristic;
                               rdfs:subPropertyOf <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/core/isConceptOf>;
                               <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> ddesc:isCharacteristicClassifiedBy;
                               <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stable"@en,
                                                                           "stabile"@it.
ddesc:creationDate a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty>,
                     <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty>;
                   rdfs:comment "This property represents the date of construction of a musical instrument's accessory."@en,
                                "Questa proprietà rappresenta la data di costruzione di un accessorio di uno strumento musicale."@it;
                   rdfs:domain ddesc:Accessory;
                   rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                   rdfs:label "creation date"@en,
                              "data di creazione"@it;
                   rdfs:range rdfs:Literal;
                   <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stable"@en,
                                                               "stabile"@it;
                   <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "ICCD Normativa SM 4.00: AS/ASS/ASSD".
ddesc:hasAccessory a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
                   rdfs:comment "This property relates a musical good to one of its accessories. In other words, it is an object linkable to a musical object, whether it is functional to the sound production, or if it is the sound's production or conservation medium."@en,
                                "Questa proprietà collega un bene musicale a un suo accessorio, ovvero un oggetto collegabile al bene musicale, sia nel caso in cui sia funzionale alla produzione del suono, sia nel caso in cui sia di supporto alla produzione del suono o alla conservazione o alla prassi musicale del bene."@it;
                   rdfs:domain <http://dati.beniculturali.it/cis/CulturalEntity>;
                   rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                   rdfs:label "has accessory"@en,
                              "ha accessorio"@it;
                   rdfs:range ddesc:Accessory;
                   <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> ddesc:isAccessoryOf;
                   <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                               "stable"@en;
                   <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "ICCD Normativa SM 4.00: AS/ASS/ASST".
ddesc:hasAffixedElement a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
                        rdfs:comment "This property relates a cultural property to an element affixed on it (e.g. inscription, stamp, etc.)"@en,
                                     "Questa proprietà collega un bene culturale a un elemento apposto sul bene (es.: emblema, timbro, iscrizione, etc.)"@it;
                        rdfs:domain <http://dati.beniculturali.it/cis/CulturalEntity>;
                        rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                        rdfs:label "has element affixed to cultural property"@en,
                                   "ha elemento apposto sul bene"@it;
                        rdfs:range ddesc:AffixedElement;
                        <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> ddesc:isElementAffixedOn;
                        <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stable"@en,
                                                                    "stabile"@it;
                        <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "ICCD Normativa Trasversale 4.00: DA/ISE - ICCD versioni precedenti alla 4.00: DA/ISR; DA/STM - ICCD Normativa A: LI/LSI - ICCD Normativa MI: AU/DDC"@it.
ddesc:hasAffixedElementType a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
                            rdfs:comment "Questa proprietà collega un'iscrizione, un emblema, un timbro, uno stemma, etc., al suo tipo (es.: gentilizio, civile, religioso, etc.)"@it,
                                         "This property relatesan inscription (or an emblem, a mark, etc.) to its type."@en;
                            rdfs:domain ddesc:AffixedElement;
                            rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                            rdfs:label "has affixed element type"@en,
                                       "ha tipo di elemento apposto"@it;
                            rdfs:range ddesc:AffixedElementType;
                            rdfs:subPropertyOf <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/core/hasType>;
                            <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> ddesc:isAffixedElementTypeOf;
                            <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stable"@en,
                                                                        "stabile"@it;
                            <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "ICCD Normativa Trasversale 4.00: DA/ISE/ISEE - Normative di versioni precedenti: DA/STM/STMQ"@it.
ddesc:hasAvailableNotes a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
                        rdfs:comment "Questa proprietà collega uno strumento musicale, dal grave all'acuto, alle note producibili dallo strumento."@it,
                                     "This property relates a musical instrument to the playable notes by it, from low to high."@en;
                        rdfs:domain <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing>;
                        rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                        rdfs:label "has available notes"@en,
                                   "ha note producibili"@it;
                        rdfs:range ddesc:TechnicalCharacteristic;
                        rdfs:subPropertyOf ddesc:hasTechnicalCharacteristic;
                        <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                                    "stable"@en.
ddesc:hasCommunicationMedium a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
                             rdfs:comment "Questa proprietà collega un bene culturale immateriale a una modalità comunicativa mediante la quale il bene viene veicolato."@it,
                                          "This property relates an intangible cultural property to a communication medium."@en;
                             rdfs:domain <http://dati.beniculturali.it/cis/CulturalEntity>;
                             rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                             rdfs:label "ha modalità comunicativa"@it,
                                        "has communication medium"@en;
                             rdfs:range ddesc:CommunicationMedium;
                             rdfs:subPropertyOf <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/core/hasCulturalEntityCharacteristic>;
                             <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> ddesc:isCommunicationMediumOf;
                             <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stable"@en,
                                                                         "stabile"@it;
                             <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "ICCD Normativa BDI: CU".
ddesc:hasCommunicationMediumType a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
                                 rdfs:comment "This property relates a communication medium to its type (e.g.: verbal, singing, etc.)"@en,
                                              "Questa proprietà collega una modalità comunicativa di un oggetto al tipo di modalità comunicativa (verbale, strumentale, etc.)"@it;
                                 rdfs:domain ddesc:CommunicationMedium;
                                 rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                                 rdfs:label "ha tipo di modalità comunicativa"@it,
                                            "has communication medium type"@en;
                                 rdfs:range ddesc:CommunicationMediumType;
                                 rdfs:subPropertyOf <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/core/hasType>;
                                 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> ddesc:isCommunicationMediumTypeOf;
                                 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stable"@en,
                                                                             "stabile"@it;
                                 <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "ICCD Normativa BDI: CU".
ddesc:hasConservationStatus a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
                            rdfs:comment "This property relates the cultural property with its conservation status."@en,
                                         "Questa proprietà associa il bene culturale al suo stato di conservazione."@it;
                            rdfs:domain <http://dati.beniculturali.it/cis/CulturalEntity>;
                            rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                            rdfs:label "has conservation status"@en,
                                       "ha stato di conservazione"@it;
                            rdfs:range ddesc:ConservationStatus;
                            rdfs:subPropertyOf <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/core/hasSituation>;
                            <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> ddesc:isConservationStatusOf;
                            <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                                        "stable"@en;
                            <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "CO/STC".
ddesc:hasConservationStatusType a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
                                rdfs:comment "Questa proprietà associa lo stato di conservazione a uno dei valori del tipo di stato di conservazione."@it,
                                             "This property relates a conservation status to one of its type's values."@en;
                                rdfs:domain ddesc:ConservationStatus;
                                rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                                rdfs:label "ha tipo di stato di conservazione"@it,
                                           "has conservation status type"@en;
                                rdfs:range ddesc:ConservationStatusType;
                                rdfs:subPropertyOf <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/core/hasType>;
                                <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> ddesc:isConservationStatusTypeOf;
                                <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stable"@en,
                                                                            "stabile"@it;
                                <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "CO/STC/STCC".
ddesc:hasCulturalPropertyAccessibility a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
                                       rdfs:comment "Questa proprietà collega il bene culturale alla sua accessibilità, ovvero la possibilità di accedere al bene, in tutto o in parte, per esempio per effettuare un esame diretto finalizzato alla catalogazione (es.: un bene immobile posto in un luogo recintato non accessibile, un bene mobile che non si può osservare da vicino perché posto troppo in alto su una parete; un bene totalmente accessibile, etc.)."@it,
                                                    "This property relates the cultural property to its accessibility, that is the possibility to reach or enter that cultural property, for example for cataloguing activities (e.g.: an immovable cultural property located in a walled area, a movable cultural property located on the top shelf, a totally accessible cultural property, etc.)"@en;
                                       rdfs:domain <http://dati.beniculturali.it/cis/CulturalEntity>;
                                       rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                                       rdfs:label "ha accessibilità"@it,
                                                  "has cultural property accessibility"@en;
                                       rdfs:range ddesc:CulturalPropertyAccessibility;
                                       rdfs:subPropertyOf <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/core/hasCulturalEntityCharacteristic>;
                                       <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> ddesc:isCulturalPropertyAccessibilityOf;
                                       <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stable"@en,
                                                                                   "stabile"@it;
                                       <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "ICCD Normativa Trasversale 4.00: LC/ACB".
ddesc:hasCulturalPropertyAvailability a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
                                      rdfs:comment "This class relates the cultural property to its availability, that is wheter the cultural property is available or not (e.g.: theft, destruction) for example for cataloguing activities."@en,
                                                   "Questa proprietà collega il bene culturale alla sua disponibilità materiale, ovvero se il bene è materialmente disponibile, per esempio per attività di catalogazione, o se non è disponibile (es.: furto, distruzione)"@it;
                                      rdfs:domain <http://dati.beniculturali.it/cis/CulturalEntity>;
                                      rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                                      rdfs:label "has cultural property availability"@en,
                                                 "ha disponibilità materiale"@it;
                                      rdfs:range ddesc:CulturalPropertyAvailability;
                                      rdfs:subPropertyOf <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/core/hasCulturalEntityCharacteristic>;
                                      <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> ddesc:isCulturalPropertyAvailabilityOf;
                                      <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                                                  "stable"@en;
                                      <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "ICCD Normativa Trasversale 4.00: OG/OGR".
ddesc:hasCulturalPropertyDefinition a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
                                    rdfs:comment "Questa proprietà collega la tipologia di un bene culturale a una delle sue componenti, cioè la definizione."@it,
                                                 "This property relates a cultural entity's typology to one of its components, i.e.  its definition."@en;
                                    rdfs:domain ddesc:CulturalPropertyType;
                                    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                                    rdfs:label "ha definizione del bene culturale"@it,
                                               "has cultural property definition"@en;
                                    rdfs:range ddesc:CulturalPropertyDefinition;
                                    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> ddesc:isCulturalPropertyDefinitionOf;
                                    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                                                "stable"@en;
                                    <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "OG/OGT/OGTD".
ddesc:hasCulturalPropertySpecification a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
                                       rdfs:comment "This property relates a cultural entity's typology to its components, i.e. morphological and functional specifications."@en,
                                                    "Questa proprietà collega la tipologia di un bene culturale a una delle sue componenti, cioè alle specifiche morfologiche e funzionali."@it;
                                       rdfs:domain ddesc:CulturalPropertyType;
                                       rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                                       rdfs:label "has cultural property specification"@en,
                                                  "ha specifiche del bene culturale"@it;
                                       rdfs:range ddesc:CulturalPropertySpecification;
                                       <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> ddesc:isCulturalPropertySpecificationOf;
                                       <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                                                   "stable"@en;
                                       <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "OG/OGT/OGTT".
ddesc:hasCulturalPropertyType a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
                              rdfs:comment "This property relates a cultural property to its type."@en,
                                           "Questa proprietà collega un bene culturale al tipo di bene, per permettere la corretta e precisa individuazione del bene."@it;
                              rdfs:domain <http://dati.beniculturali.it/cis/CulturalEntity>;
                              rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                              rdfs:label "has cultural property type"@en,
                                         "ha tipo di bene culturale"@it;
                              rdfs:range ddesc:CulturalPropertyType;
                              rdfs:subPropertyOf <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/core/hasType>;
                              <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> ddesc:isCulturalPropertyTypeOf;
                              <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                                          "stable"@en;
                              <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "OG/OGT".
ddesc:hasDedicatee a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
                   rdfs:comment "Questa proprietà collega una dedica al dedicatario, cioè alla persona o ente cui è rivolta la dedica."@it,
                                "This property connects a dedication to its dedicaatee, which is the person or institution to whom the dedication is addressed."@en;
                   rdfs:domain ddesc:Dedication;
                   rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                   rdfs:label "has dedicatee"@en,
                              "ha dedicatario"@it;
                   rdfs:range <https://w3id.org/italia/onto/l0/Agent>;
                   <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> ddesc:isDedicateeOf;
                   <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stable"@en,
                                                               "stabile"@it;
                   <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "ICCD Normativa MI 3.00: AU/DDC/DDCM".
ddesc:hasDesignationInTime a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
                           rdfs:comment "This property connects a cultural entity to its denomination and/or dedication, or title (for FF legislation) over time."@en,
                                        "Questa proprietà associa un bene culturale alla sua denominazione e/o dedicazione o, per la normativa FF, titolo, nel corso del tempo."@it;
                           rdfs:domain <http://dati.beniculturali.it/cis/CulturalEntity>;
                           rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                           rdfs:label "has designation in time"@en,
                                      "ha designazione nel tempo"@it;
                           rdfs:range ddesc:DesignationInTime;
                           rdfs:subPropertyOf <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/core/hasSituation>;
                           <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> ddesc:isDesignationInTimeOf;
                           <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stable"@en,
                                                                       "stabile"@it;
                           <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "ICCD Normativa Trasversale 4.00: OG/OGD".
ddesc:hasDesignationType a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
                         rdfs:comment "This property relates a cultural entity designation to its type."@en;
                         rdfs:domain ddesc:DesignationInTime;
                         rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                         rdfs:label "has designation type"@en,
                                    "ha tipo di denominazione"@it;
                         rdfs:range ddesc:DesignationType;
                         rdfs:subPropertyOf <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/core/hasType>;
                         <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> ddesc:isDesignationTypeOf;
                         <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                                     "Questa proprietà collega una denominazione o dedicazione o, per la normativa FF, titolo nel tempo al tipo di denominazione del bene (altra lingua, attribuita, attuale, dialettale, etc.)"@it,
                                                                     "stable"@en;
                         <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "ICCD Normativa Trasversale 4.00: OG/OGD/OGDT".
ddesc:hasDiapason a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
                  rdfs:comment "Questa proprietà collega uno strumento musical al corista rilevato (nota, temperatura ed eventualmente umidità ambientale al momento della rilevazione)."@it,
                               "This property relates a musical instrument to the identified diapason (note, temperature and eventually humidity during the detection)."@en;
                  rdfs:domain <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing>;
                  rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                  rdfs:label "has diapason"@en,
                             "ha corista"@it;
                  rdfs:range ddesc:TechnicalCharacteristic;
                  rdfs:subPropertyOf ddesc:hasTechnicalCharacteristic;
                  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> ddesc:isDiapasonOf;
                  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stable"@en,
                                                              "stabile"@it.
ddesc:hasExtension a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
                   rdfs:comment "Questa proprietà collega uno strumento musicale alla sua estensione musicale."@it,
                                "This property relates a musical instrument to its extension."@en;
                   rdfs:domain <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing>;
                   rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                   rdfs:label "ha estensione"@it,
                              "has extension"@en;
                   rdfs:range ddesc:TechnicalCharacteristic;
                   rdfs:subPropertyOf ddesc:hasTechnicalCharacteristic;
                   <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> ddesc:isExtensionOf;
                   <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stable"@en,
                                                               "stabile"@it.
ddesc:hasFileFormat a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
                    rdfs:comment "Questa proprietà collega una risorsa digitale su supporto informatico al formato utilizzato per la scrittura della risorsa."@it,
                                 "This property relates a digital resource to the format used to write it on a data medium."@en;
                    rdfs:domain <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing>;
                    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                    rdfs:label "has file format"@en,
                               "ha formato di estensione/compressione del file"@it;
                    rdfs:range ddesc:TechnicalCharacteristic;
                    rdfs:subPropertyOf ddesc:hasTechnicalCharacteristic;
                    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> ddesc:isFileFormatOf;
                    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stable"@en,
                                                                "stabile"@it.
ddesc:hasFiligree a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
                  rdfs:comment "Questa proprietà collega un'opera d'arte, un disegno, una fotografia, una stampa alla sua filigrana."@it,
                               "This property relates an artwork, painting, photography, print to its filigree."@en;
                  rdfs:domain <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing>;
                  rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                  rdfs:label "ha filigrana"@it,
                             "has filigree"@en;
                  rdfs:range ddesc:TechnicalCharacteristic;
                  rdfs:subPropertyOf ddesc:hasTechnicalCharacteristic;
                  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> ddesc:isFiligreeOf;
                  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stable"@en,
                                                              "stabile"@it.
ddesc:hasFontStyle a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
                   rdfs:comment "This property connects an inscription or emblem, postmark, crest, etc. to the font style which has been adopted (e.g.: italic, bold, gothic etc)."@en,
                                "Questa proprietà collega un'iscrizione, uno stemma, un timbro, etc., al tipo di caratteri che viene adottato (es.: corsivo, grassetto, caratteri gotici, etc.)."@it;
                   rdfs:domain ddesc:AffixedElement;
                   rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                   rdfs:label "ha tipo di caratteri"@it,
                              "has font style"@en;
                   rdfs:range ddesc:FontStyle;
                   <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> ddesc:isFontStyleOf;
                   <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stable"@en,
                                                               "stabile"@it;
                   <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "ICCD Normativa Traversale 4.00: DA/ISE/ISET - Normative di versioni precedenti: DA/ISR/ISRT"@it.
ddesc:hasFunctionalPurpose a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
                           rdfs:comment "Questa proprietà collega un oggetto (es bene culturale, apparato iconografico/decorativo o elemento apposto su un bene culturale come un'iscrizione) al suo scopo funzionale (decorativo, religioso, simbolico, magico-offensivo, etc.), inteso come funzione che deve svolgere."@it,
                                        "This property realtes an object (e.g. cultural entity, iconographic/decorative apparatus, affixed element like an inscription) to its functional purpose, intended as the function the object has to perform (decorative, religious, symbolic, magic-offensive etc.)."@en;
                           rdfs:domain <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing>;
                           rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                           rdfs:label "has functional purpose"@en,
                                      "ha scopo funzionale"@it;
                           rdfs:range ddesc:FunctionalPurpose;
                           rdfs:subPropertyOf <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/core/hasCharacteristic>;
                           <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> ddesc:isFunctionalPurposeOf;
                           <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stable"@en,
                                                                       "stabile"@it;
                           <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "ICCD Normativa Trasversale: DA/ISE/ISEC - Normative di versioni precedenti: DA/ISR/ISRC; DA/APF/APFF"@it.
ddesc:hasGarmentAnalysis a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
                         rdfs:comment "Questa proprietà collega un vestimento antico o contemporaneo alla definizione tecnica completa dei tessuti, secondo le norme fornite dal C.I.E.T.A., o dei merletti, oppure rappresenta la distinzione fra tessuto unito e tessuto operato."@it,
                                      "This property relates an ancient or contemporary garment to the technical definition of textured fabrics, according to the standard provided by C.I.E.T.A., or laces. It can represent the dinstinction between plain fabric and textured fabric."@en;
                         rdfs:domain <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing>;
                         rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                         rdfs:label "ha analisi del vestimento"@it,
                                    "has garment analysis"@en;
                         rdfs:range ddesc:TechnicalCharacteristic;
                         rdfs:subPropertyOf ddesc:hasTechnicalCharacteristic;
                         <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> ddesc:isGarmentAnalysisOf;
                         <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stable"@en,
                                                                     "stabile"@it.
ddesc:hasGarmentColour a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
                       rdfs:comment "This property relates an ancient and contemporary garment to its dominant color, usually it is base fabric's color, or the interlaced decoration's color."@en,
                                    "Questa proprietà collega un vestimento antico o contemporaneo al colore dominante, di solito quello del fondo del tessuto, o quello risultante dall'intreccio."@it;
                       rdfs:domain <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing>;
                       rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                       rdfs:label "has garment colour"@en,
                                  "ha colore del vestimento"@it;
                       rdfs:range ddesc:TechnicalCharacteristic;
                       rdfs:subPropertyOf ddesc:hasTechnicalCharacteristic;
                       <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> ddesc:isGarmentColourOf;
                       <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stable"@en,
                                                                   "stabile"@it.
ddesc:hasIconographicOrDecorativeApparatus a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
                                           rdfs:comment "Questa proprietà collega un bene culturale al suo apparato iconografico e/o decorativo, inteso come l'insieme, che può essere più o meno complesso, delle rappresentazioni iconografiche e/o delle decorazioni presenti sul bene."@it,
                                                        "This property relates a cultural enitity to its iconographic or decorative apparatus."@en;
                                           rdfs:domain <http://dati.beniculturali.it/cis/CulturalEntity>;
                                           rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                                           rdfs:label "has iconographic or decorative apparatus"@en,
                                                      "ha apparato iconografico e decorativo"@it;
                                           rdfs:range ddesc:IconographicOrDecorativeApparatus;
                                           rdfs:subPropertyOf <https://w3id.org/italia/onto/l0/hasDescription>;
                                           <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> ddesc:isIconographicOrDecorativeApparatusOf;
                                           <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stable"@en,
                                                                                       "stabile"@it;
                                           <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "ICCD Normativa Trasversale 4.00: DA/AID - ICCD Normative PST e BDM: DA/APF".
ddesc:hasIconographicOrDecorativeApparatusType a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty>,
                                                 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
                                               rdfs:comment "Questa proprietà collega un apparato iconografico e decorativo di un bene culturale al tipo di apparato (iconografico, decorativo, iconografico-decorativo)."@it,
                                                            "This property relates a iconographic or decorative apparatus to its type."@en;
                                               rdfs:domain ddesc:IconographicOrDecorativeApparatus;
                                               rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                                               rdfs:label "has iconographic or decorative apparatus type"@en,
                                                          "ha tipo di apparato iconografico e decorativo"@it;
                                               rdfs:range ddesc:IconographicOrDecorativeApparatusType;
                                               rdfs:subPropertyOf <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/core/hasType>;
                                               <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> ddesc:isIconographicOrDecorativeApparatusTypeOf;
                                               <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                                                           "stable"@en.
ddesc:hasImplementationMethod a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
                              rdfs:comment "This property relates a verbal or singing or instrumental communication medium to its implementation method (e.g.: polyphonic) associated to it."@en,
                                           "Questa proprietà collega una modalità comunicativa verbale o musicale vocale o musicale strumentale alla modalità esecutiva associata (es.: polifonica)."@it;
                              rdfs:domain ddesc:CommunicationMedium;
                              rdfs:label "ha modalità esecutiva"@it,
                                         "has implementation method"@en;
                              rdfs:range ddesc:ImplementationMethod;
                              <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> ddesc:isImplementationMethodOf;
                              <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                                          "stable"@en;
                              <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "ICCD Normativa BDI: CU/CUM/CUMD; CU/CUS/CUSD".
ddesc:hasLegibility a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
                    rdfs:comment "Questa proprietà collega lo stato di conservazione di un bene numismatico al suo stato di leggibilità."@it,
                                 "This property relates a numismatic entity's conservation status to its legibility status."@en;
                    rdfs:domain ddesc:ConservationStatus;
                    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                    rdfs:label "ha leggibilità"@it,
                               "has legibility"@en;
                    rdfs:range ddesc:Legibility;
                    rdfs:subPropertyOf <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/core/hasCharacteristic>;
                    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> ddesc:isLegibilityOf;
                    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stable"@en,
                                                                "stabile"@it;
                    <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "ICCD Normativa NU: CO/STC/STCL".
ddesc:hasLocationSubject a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
                         rdfs:comment "Questa proprietà rappresenta l'area rappresentata come soggetto di un bene culturale."@it,
                                      "This property represent the location as a subject of a cultural entity."@en;
                         rdfs:domain <http://dati.beniculturali.it/cis/CulturalEntity>;
                         rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                         rdfs:label "ha localizzazione rappresentata"@it,
                                    "has location as subject"@en;
                         rdfs:range <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/location/TimeIndexedTypedLocation>;
                         <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> ddesc:isLocationSubjectOf;
                         <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                                     "stable"@en;
                         <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> """se 4.00 LA/TLC o versioni precedenti a 4.00 LA/TCL = \"area rappresentata\""""@it.
ddesc:hasMassStorage a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
                     rdfs:comment "Questa proprietà collega una risorsa digitale alla memoria di massa nella quale è stata memorizzata la fotografia digitale."@it,
                                  "This property relates a digital photograph to the mass storage where a digital photograph is stored."@en;
                     rdfs:domain <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing>;
                     rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                     rdfs:label "ha memoria di massa"@it,
                                "has mass storage"@en;
                     rdfs:range ddesc:TechnicalCharacteristic;
                     rdfs:subPropertyOf ddesc:hasTechnicalCharacteristic;
                     <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> ddesc:isMassStorageOf;
                     <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                                 "stable"@en.
ddesc:hasMaterial a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
                  rdfs:comment "This property relates an object to its material."@en,
                               "Questa proprietà collega un oggetto (per esempio un bene culturale) alla materia con cui è realizzato."@it;
                  rdfs:domain <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing>;
                  rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                  rdfs:label "has material"@en,
                             "ha materia"@it;
                  rdfs:range ddesc:TechnicalCharacteristic;
                  rdfs:subPropertyOf ddesc:hasMaterialOrTechnique;
                  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> ddesc:isMaterialOf;
                  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stable"@en,
                                                              "stabile"@it.
ddesc:hasMaterialOrTechnique a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
                             rdfs:comment "This property relates an object to the material or technique through which an object has been realized, e.g. a cultural entity. In ICCD standards for cataloguing cultural entities, this label is necessary when material and technique are registered in the same field."@en,
                                          """Questa proprietà collega un oggetto alla materia e/o la tecnica con cui è realizzato l'oggetto, per esempio un bene culturale. Nel dominio delle normative  ICCD per la catalogazione dei beni culturali, si rende necessaria nei casi in cui materia e tecnica sono registrate nello stesso campo, nella forma \"materia/ tecnica\"."""@it;
                             rdfs:domain <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing>;
                             rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                             rdfs:label "has material or technique"@en,
                                        "ha materia e tecnica"@it;
                             rdfs:range ddesc:TechnicalCharacteristic;
                             rdfs:subPropertyOf ddesc:hasTechnicalCharacteristic;
                             <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> ddesc:isMaterialOrTechniqueOf;
                             <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stable"@en,
                                                                         "stabile"@it.
ddesc:hasMeasurement <http://ontologydesignpatterns.org/opla/isNativeTo> <https://w3id.org/arco/pattern/object-collection/>;
                     a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
                     rdfs:comment "Questa proprietà collega un insieme di misure osservate per un oggetto a una delle misure."@it,
                                  "This property connects a set of observed measures on an object to one of those measures."@en;
                     rdfs:domain ddesc:MeasurementCollection;
                     rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                     rdfs:label "ha misura"@it,
                                "has measurement"@en;
                     rdfs:range ddesc:Measurement;
                     <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> ddesc:isMeasurementIn;
                     <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                                 "stable"@en;
                     <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "MT/MIS - Normativa VeAC: anche MT/MIM"@it.
ddesc:hasMeasurementCollection a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
                               rdfs:comment "Questa proprietà collega un oggetto all'insieme delle misure osservate per quell'oggetto."@it,
                                            "This property connects an object to the collection of observed measures on it."@en;
                               rdfs:domain <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing>;
                               rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                               rdfs:label "ha collezione di misure"@it,
                                          "has measurement collection"@en;
                               rdfs:range ddesc:MeasurementCollection;
                               <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> ddesc:isMeasurementCollectionOf;
                               <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                                           "stable"@en;
                               <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "MT/MIS - Normativa VeAC: anche MT/MII e MT/MIM"@it.
ddesc:hasMeasurementType a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
                         rdfs:comment "This property relates a measurement to its type."@en,
                                      "Questa proprietà collega una misura al tipo di misura (altezza, larghezza, diametro, etc.)"@it;
                         rdfs:domain ddesc:Measurement;
                         rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                         rdfs:label "ha tipo di misura"@it,
                                    "has measurement type"@en;
                         rdfs:range ddesc:MeasurementType;
                         rdfs:subPropertyOf <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/core/hasType>;
                         <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> ddesc:isMeasurementTypeOf;
                         <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                                     "stable"@en;
                         <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "ICCD Normativa Trasversale: MT/MIS/MISZ; MT/MNR - Per versioni di normativa precedenti alla 4.00: MT/MIS/MISA; MT/MIS/MISD; MT/MIS/MISL; MT/MIS/MISN; MT/MIS/MISG; MT/MIS/MISP; MT/MIS/MISS; MT/MIS/MISR; MT/MIS/MISV - ICCD scheda VeAC: MT/MII/MIIA; MT/MII/MIIL; MT/MII/MIIP; MT/MIS/MISR; MT/MIS/MISD; MT/MIS/MISS; MT/MIS/MISP; MT/MIS/MISV; MT/MIS/MISF; MT/MIS/MISO"@it.
ddesc:hasOrientation a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
                     rdfs:comment "Questa proprietà collega un oggetto al suo orientamento, secondo l'asse principale individuato."@it,
                                  "This property connects an object to its orientation, considering its major axis."@en;
                     rdfs:domain <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing>;
                     rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                     rdfs:label "has orientation"@en,
                                "ha orientamento"@it;
                     rdfs:range ddesc:Orientation;
                     <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> ddesc:isOrientationOf;
                     <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                                 "stable"@en;
                     <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "ICCD Normativa Trasversale: MT/ORT - ICCD Schede CA e MA: MT/ORT"@it.
ddesc:hasOrnamentalMotif a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
                         rdfs:comment "Questa proprietà collega l'apparato iconografico e decorativo di un bene culturale al motivo decorativo (antropomorfo, zoomorfo, geometrico) rappresentato."@it,
                                      "This property connects a cultural entity's iconographic or decorative apparatus to its ornamental motif (anthropomorphic, zoomorphic, geometric)."@en;
                         rdfs:domain ddesc:IconographicOrDecorativeApparatus;
                         rdfs:isDefinedBy "unstable"@en,
                                          "provvisoria"@it,
                                          <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                         rdfs:label "ha motivo decorativo"@it,
                                    "has ornamental motif"@en;
                         rdfs:range ddesc:OrnamentalMotif;
                         <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> ddesc:isOrnamentalMotifOf.
ddesc:hasPhotoColour a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
                     rdfs:comment "This property relates a digital photograph to its colour, i.e. black and white or colours."@en,
                                  "Questo individuo collega una fotografia digitale al colore della fotografia digitale, ovvero se trattasi di fotografia in bianco/nero o a colori."@it;
                     rdfs:domain <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing>;
                     rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                     rdfs:label "has photo colour"@en,
                                "ha colore della foto"@it;
                     rdfs:range ddesc:TechnicalCharacteristic;
                     rdfs:subPropertyOf ddesc:hasTechnicalCharacteristic;
                     <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> ddesc:isPhotoColourOf;
                     <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                                 "stable"@en.
ddesc:hasPhotoProgram a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
                      rdfs:comment "Questa proprietà collega una fotografia digitale al programma di visualizzazione, memorizzazione ed elaborazione utilizzato per la fotografia digitale."@it,
                                   "This property relates a digital photograph to the visualization, storage and processing program used for the digital photograph."@en;
                      rdfs:domain <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing>;
                      rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                      rdfs:label "ha programma per foto"@it,
                                 "has photo program"@en;
                      rdfs:range ddesc:TechnicalCharacteristic;
                      rdfs:subPropertyOf ddesc:hasTechnicalCharacteristic;
                      <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> ddesc:isPhotoProgramOf;
                      <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                                  "stable"@en.
ddesc:hasPhotoSize a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
                   rdfs:comment "This property relates a digital photograph to its format, intended as the photographic material's standardised size (e.g. negative, positives)."@en,
                                "Questa proprietà collega una risorsa digitale al formato della risorsa, inteso come la dimensione standardizzata (es.: per i materiali fotografici negativi, positivi, ecc.)."@it;
                   rdfs:domain <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing>;
                   rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                   rdfs:label "has photo size"@en,
                              "ha dimensioni della foto"@it;
                   rdfs:range ddesc:TechnicalCharacteristic;
                   rdfs:subPropertyOf ddesc:hasTechnicalCharacteristic;
                   <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> ddesc:isPhotoSizeOf;
                   <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                               "stable"@en.
ddesc:hasPixelDimension a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
                        rdfs:comment "Questa proprietà collega un'immagine digitale (es.: fotografia) alle dimensioni, in pixel, dell'immagine."@it,
                                     "This property relates a digital resource to its size in pixels."@en;
                        rdfs:domain <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing>;
                        rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                        rdfs:label "has pixel dimension"@en,
                                   "ha dimensioni in pixel"@it;
                        rdfs:range ddesc:TechnicalCharacteristic;
                        rdfs:subPropertyOf ddesc:hasTechnicalCharacteristic;
                        <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> ddesc:isPixelDimensionOf;
                        <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stable"@en,
                                                                    "stabile"@it.
ddesc:hasQualityLevel a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
                      rdfs:comment "This property relates a digital resource to its quality level, e.g. high-resolution, low-resolution, preview."@en,
                                   "Questa proprietà collega una risorsa digitale al livello di qualità della risorsa (es.: alta risoluzione, bassa risoluzione, preview)"@it;
                      rdfs:domain <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing>;
                      rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                      rdfs:label "ha livello di qualità"@it,
                                 "has quality level"@en;
                      rdfs:range ddesc:TechnicalCharacteristic;
                      rdfs:subPropertyOf ddesc:hasTechnicalCharacteristic;
                      <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> ddesc:isQualityLevelOf;
                      <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stable"@en,
                                                                  "stabile"@it.
ddesc:hasResolution a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
                    rdfs:comment "Questa proprietà collega una fotografia alla risoluzione e al valore specifico utilizzati per la memorizzazione di una fotografia digitale."@it,
                                 "This property relates a digital resource to theresolution used for storing it."@en;
                    rdfs:domain <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing>;
                    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                    rdfs:label "has resolution"@en,
                               "ha risoluzione"@it;
                    rdfs:range ddesc:TechnicalCharacteristic;
                    rdfs:subPropertyOf ddesc:hasTechnicalCharacteristic;
                    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> ddesc:isResolutionOf;
                    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stable"@en,
                                                                "stabile"@it.
ddesc:hasSampleCollected a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
                         rdfs:comment "Questa proprietà collega un bene archeologico a un campione prelevato da esso."@it,
                                      "This property connects a archaeological entity to a sample collected from it."@en;
                         rdfs:domain <http://dati.beniculturali.it/cis/CulturalEntity>;
                         rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                         rdfs:label "has sample collected"@en,
                                    "ha campione prelevato"@it;
                         rdfs:range ddesc:SampleCollected;
                         <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> ddesc:isSampleCollectedFrom;
                         <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stable"@en,
                                                                     "stabile"@it;
                         <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "ICCD Normativa MA, CA, SI, SAS: MC/CMN".
ddesc:hasSampleCollectedType a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>,
                               <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty>;
                             rdfs:comment "Questa proprietà collega un campione prelevato da un bene archeologico al tipo di campione (es.: intonaco, carbone, etc.)"@it,
                                          "This property relates a sample collected to its type."@en;
                             rdfs:domain ddesc:SampleCollected;
                             rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                             rdfs:label "has sample collected type"@en,
                                        "ha tipo di campione prelevato"@it;
                             rdfs:range ddesc:SampleCollectedType;
                             rdfs:subPropertyOf <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/core/hasType>;
                             <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> ddesc:isSampleCollectedTypeOf;
                             <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                                         "stable"@en;
                             <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "ICCD Normativa MA, CA, SI, SAS: MC/CMN/CMNT".
ddesc:hasShape a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
               rdfs:comment "This property relates an object to its shape. It is used for bidimensional objects, e.g. octagonal or round shape."@en,
                            "Questa proprietà collega un oggetto al formato dell'oggetto, per oggetti bidimensionali (es.: ottagonale, tondo)"@it;
               rdfs:domain <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing>;
               rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
               rdfs:label "ha forma"@it,
                          "has shape"@en;
               rdfs:range ddesc:TechnicalCharacteristic;
               rdfs:subPropertyOf ddesc:hasTechnicalCharacteristic;
               <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> ddesc:isShapeOf;
               <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                           "stable"@en.
ddesc:hasStorageMethodOrColourDepth a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
                                    rdfs:comment "Questa proprietà collega una fotografia al metodo e alla profondità di colore con cui è stata memorizzata la fotografia digitale."@it,
                                                 "This property relates a digital photograph to the method and color depth through which a digital photograph has been stored."@en;
                                    rdfs:domain <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing>;
                                    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                                    rdfs:label "has storage method or colour depth"@en,
                                               "ha metodo di memorizzazione e profondità del colore"@it;
                                    rdfs:range ddesc:TechnicalCharacteristic;
                                    rdfs:subPropertyOf ddesc:hasTechnicalCharacteristic;
                                    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> ddesc:isStorageMethodOrColourDepthOf;
                                    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                                                "stable"@en.
ddesc:hasSupport a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
                 rdfs:comment "This property connects an inscription, stamp, emblem etc., represented on a cultural entity to the support on which the entity is located."@en,
                              "Questa proprietà collega una iscrizione, un timbro, un emblema, etc., rappresentato su un bene culturale al supporto su cui si trova l'elemento."@it;
                 rdfs:domain ddesc:AffixedElement;
                 rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                 rdfs:label "has support"@en,
                            "ha supporto"@it;
                 rdfs:range ddesc:Support;
                 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> ddesc:isSupportOf;
                 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stable"@en,
                                                             "stabile"@it;
                 <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "ICCD Normativa Trasversale 4.00: DA/ISE/ISES".
ddesc:hasTechnicalCharacteristic a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
                                 rdfs:comment "This property relates an entity to a technical characteristic (e.g. material, technique, colour, quality level)."@en,
                                              "Questa proprietà collega un'entità a una caratteristica tecnica (es.: materia, tecnica, colore, livello di qualità, formato)."@it;
                                 rdfs:domain <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing>;
                                 rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                                 rdfs:label "ha caratteristica tecnica"@it,
                                            "has technical characteristic"@en;
                                 rdfs:range ddesc:TechnicalCharacteristic;
                                 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> ddesc:isTechnicalCharacteristicOf;
                                 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#propertyChainAxiom> (ddesc:hasTechnicalStatus
                                                                                     ddesc:includesTechnicalCharacteristic);
                                 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stable"@en,
                                                                             "stabile"@it.
ddesc:hasTechnicalStatus a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
                         rdfs:comment "This property connects a cultural entity to its technical status, valid until a specific moment, that is represented by the technical characteristics that a cultural entity has in that moment."@en,
                                      "Questa proprietà collega un'entità culturale al suo stato tecnico, valido fino a determinato momento, che è rappresentato dalle caratteristiche tecniche che il bene culturale ha in quel momento."@it;
                         rdfs:domain <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing>;
                         rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                         rdfs:label "has technical status"@en,
                                    "ha stato tecnico"@it;
                         rdfs:range ddesc:CulturalEntityTechnicalStatus;
                         rdfs:subPropertyOf <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/core/hasSituation>;
                         <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> ddesc:isTechnicalStatusOf;
                         <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                                     "stable"@en;
                         <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "ICCD Normativa Trasversale 4.00: MT/MTC/MTCM; MT/MTC/MTCT - Normativa OA, D, F, S, MI: MT/FRM - Normativa OA, D, F, S: MT/FIL - Normativa VeAC: MT/MTC/MTCC; MT/MTC/MTCF - Normativa F: MT/FVC/FVCC; MT/FVC/FVCF; MT/FVC/FVCP; MT/FVC/FVCU; MT/FVC/FVCM; MT/FVM;".
ddesc:hasTechnique a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
                   rdfs:comment "This property relates an object to its execution technique."@en,
                                "Questa proprietà collega un oggetto alla tecnica di esecuzione dell'oggetto, per esempio un bene culturale."@it;
                   rdfs:domain <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing>;
                   rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                   rdfs:label "ha tecnica"@it,
                              "has technique"@en;
                   rdfs:range ddesc:TechnicalCharacteristic;
                   rdfs:subPropertyOf ddesc:hasMaterialOrTechnique;
                   <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> ddesc:isTechniqueOf;
                   <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stable"@en,
                                                               "stabile"@it.
ddesc:hasTemperament a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
                     rdfs:comment "Questa proprietà collega uno strumento al temperamento adottato, soprattutto in caso di oggetto in condizioni originali, o dopo un restauro, dello strumento musicale. Per gli idiofoni a tasti fissi (come xilofoni, litofoni, metallofoni) rappresenta la successione degli intervalli."@it,
                                  "This property relates a musical instrument to the adopted temperament, especially in relation to an object in its original conditions, or after its restoration. For idiophones with fixed keys (e.g. xylophone, litophone, metallophone) the temperament represents the succession of intervals."@en;
                     rdfs:domain <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing>;
                     rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                     rdfs:label "ha temperamento"@it,
                                "has temperament"@en;
                     rdfs:range ddesc:TechnicalCharacteristic;
                     rdfs:subPropertyOf ddesc:hasTechnicalCharacteristic;
                     <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> ddesc:isTemperamentOf;
                     <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                                 "stable"@en.
ddesc:hasTuning a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
                rdfs:comment "Questa proprietà collega uno strumento all'accordatura dello strumento musicale."@it,
                             "This property relates a musical instrument to its tuning."@en;
                rdfs:domain <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing>;
                rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                rdfs:label "ha accordatura"@it,
                           "has tuning"@en;
                rdfs:range ddesc:TechnicalCharacteristic;
                rdfs:subPropertyOf ddesc:hasTechnicalCharacteristic;
                <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> ddesc:isTuningOf;
                <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                            "stable"@en.
ddesc:hasValue a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
               rdfs:comment "Questa proprietà collega una misura al suo valore."@it,
                            "This property relates a measurement to its value."@en;
               rdfs:domain ddesc:Measurement;
               rdfs:label "ha valore"@it,
                          "has value"@en;
               rdfs:range <https://w3id.org/italia/onto/MU/Value>;
               <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> ddesc:isValueOf;
               <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                           "stable"@en.
ddesc:hasVibratingLenght a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
                         rdfs:comment "This property relates a musical instrument to its vibrating length, in particular a chordophone."@en,
                                      "Questa proprietà collega un uno strumento alla lunghezza vibrante dello strumento, in particolare di un cordofono."@it;
                         rdfs:domain <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing>;
                         rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                         rdfs:label "ha lunghezza vibrante"@it,
                                    "has vibrating lenght"@en;
                         rdfs:range ddesc:TechnicalCharacteristic;
                         rdfs:subPropertyOf ddesc:hasTechnicalCharacteristic;
                         <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> ddesc:isVibratingLenghtOf;
                         <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                                     "stable"@en.
ddesc:hasVolumetricDimensionsMeasurement <http://ontologydesignpatterns.org/opla/isNativeTo> <https://w3id.org/arco/pattern/object-collection/>;
                                         a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
                                         rdfs:comment "This property connects a collection of observed measures on an object to one of these measures, when the latter is relative to an ancient or contemporary apparel's size. The volumetric dimensions measurements determine the size for storage and can be considered as the object's orthogonal coordinates."@en,
                                                      "Questa proprietà collega un insieme di misure osservate per un oggetto a una dell misure, quando questa sia relativa all'ingombro di un vestimento antico o contemporaneo. Le misure ingombro determinano l'ingombro per l'immagazzinaggio e si possono quindiconsiderare le coordinate ortogonali dell'oggetto."@it;
                                         rdfs:domain ddesc:MeasurementCollection;
                                         rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                                         rdfs:label "has volumetric dimensions measurement",
                                                    "ha misura di imgombro";
                                         rdfs:range ddesc:Measurement;
                                         rdfs:subPropertyOf ddesc:hasMeasurement;
                                         <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> ddesc:isVolumetricDimensionsMeasurementIn;
                                         <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                                                     "stable"@en;
                                         <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "Normativa VeAC: MT/MII".
ddesc:hasWritingSystem a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
                       rdfs:comment "This property connects an inscription, stamp, crest etc., to the adopted writing system or alphabet."@en,
                                    "Questa proprietà collega una iscrizione, un timbro, uno stemma, etc., al sistema di scrittura/alfabeto adottati."@it;
                       rdfs:domain ddesc:AffixedElement;
                       rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                       rdfs:label "has writing system"@en,
                                  "ha sistema di scrittura"@it;
                       rdfs:range ddesc:WritingSystem;
                       <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> ddesc:isWritingSystemOf;
                       <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                                   "stable"@en;
                       <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "ICCD Normativa Trasversale 4.00: DA/ISE/ISEF".
ddesc:includesTechnicalCharacteristic <http://ontologydesignpatterns.org/opla/isNativeTo> <https://w3id.org/arco/pattern/technical-characteristic/>;
                                      a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
                                      rdfs:comment "This property connects a technical status, with respect to a specific entity (as a cultural entity) to one of the technical characteristics related to that status."@en,
                                                   "Questa proprietà collega lo stato tecnico di un'entità culturale a una delle caratteristiche tecniche dell'entità relativamente a quello stato."@it;
                                      rdfs:domain ddesc:CulturalEntityTechnicalStatus;
                                      rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                                      rdfs:label "includes technical characteristic"@en,
                                                 "include caratteristica tecnica"@it;
                                      rdfs:range ddesc:TechnicalCharacteristic;
                                      <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> ddesc:isIncludedInTechnicalStatus;
                                      <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stable"@en,
                                                                                  "stabile"@it.
ddesc:involvesAgeRange a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
                       rdfs:comment "Questa proprietà collega una modalità comunicativa (prossemica, cinesica) alla fascia d'età delle persone che attuano la comunicazione."@it,
                                    "This property relates a communication medium (proxemics, kinesic) to the age range of the participants to the communication."@en;
                       rdfs:domain ddesc:CommunicationMedium;
                       rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description>;
                       rdfs:label "coinvolge fascia d'età"@it,
                                  "involves age range"@en;
                       rdfs:range ddesc:AgeRange;
                       <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> ddesc:isAgeRangeInvolvedIn;
                       <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stable"@en,
                                                                   "stabile"@it;
                       <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/catalogue/iccdNormTag> "ICCD Normativa BDI: CU/CUC/CUCE; CU/CUP/CUPE".
ddesc:isAccessoryOf a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
                    rdfs:comment """This is the inverse property of \"has accessory\"."""@en,
