                                       <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                                                   "stable"@en.
ddesc:isCulturalPropertyDefinitionOf a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
                                     rdfs:comment """This is the inverse property of \"has cultural property definition\"."""@en,
