                               <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "stabile"@it,
                                                                           "stable"@en.
ddesc:isDedicateeOf a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
                    rdfs:comment """This is the inverse property of \"has dedicatee\"."""@en,
                                 """Questa è la proprietà inversa a \"ha dedicatario\"."""@it;
                    rdfs:domain <https://w3id.org/italia/onto/l0/Agent>;
